    <node id="&quot;E&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"e is a computed element in the bottom-right corner of the matrix, dynamically calculated based on input x; its value depends on modular arithmetic and is central to the correctness of the solution — misclassified due to type restrictions — should be concept."&lt;SEP&gt;"e is a dynamically computed matrix element in the student's program, intended to adjust the determinant value to equal x, but with flawed logic for edge cases."</data>
