    <node id="&quot;数值膨胀之美&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"数值膨胀之美是一个题目名称，描述了通过将数组中某一区间元素乘以2来最小化极差的优化问题，体现了数学与算法设计中的巧妙性。"&lt;SEP&gt;"数值膨胀之美是该问题的标题，描述了通过将区间内元素乘以2（数值膨胀）来优化数组极差的算法挑战事件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"数值膨胀之美是一个题目名称，描述了通过选择一个非空区间将所有元素乘以2来最小化数组极差的优化问题。"&lt;SEP&gt;"数值膨胀之美是题目的标题，描述了将数组中某区间元素乘以2所带来的数值变化过程，是问题的核心操作事件。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-802a483142e00c23622efad16d2e5519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29266653556f4758c4fbea2541c63207&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c9647dca18b1c8953d3725e54e2230&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3eac5a8ba5cac7de40889ced9fb5315</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;极差&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"极差是数组中最大值与最小值之差，是小红试图最小化的数学目标量，是本题优化问题的核心指标。"&lt;SEP&gt;"极差是数组中最大值与最小值之差，是本题的核心优化目标，学生程序试图通过乘2操作最小化该值。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-11c9647dca18b1c8953d3725e54e2230&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29266653556f4758c4fbea2541c63207</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;乘以2操作&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"乘以2操作是指选择数组中的一个非空连续区间，将其所有元素乘以2的唯一允许操作，是解决问题的关键手段。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-11c9647dca18b1c8953d3725e54e2230</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;非空区间&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"非空区间指数组中至少包含一个元素的连续子序列，是乘以2操作的作用范围，必须被正确枚举才能获得最优解。"&lt;SEP&gt;"非空区间是指数组中连续的一个或多个元素构成的子段，小红仅能选择一个这样的区间执行乘2操作。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-11c9647dca18b1c8953d3725e54e2230&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29266653556f4758c4fbea2541c63207</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;排序&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"排序是学生程序中使用的预处理步骤，将数组元素按升序排列，但该操作掩盖了原始位置信息，导致无法正确模拟区间乘2的影响。"&lt;SEP&gt;"排序是学生程序中的关键步骤，依据 l_i 和 r_i 对区间进行升序排列，以贪心分配数值，但排序规则不完善导致错误。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-11c9647dca18b1c8953d3725e54e2230&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99c195bf139756748ff95a63861cbef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;A[N] - A[1] * 2&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FORMULA"</data>
      <data key="d1">"a[n] - a[1] * 2 是学生程序中错误使用的计算公式，试图比较最大值与最小值翻倍后的差值，但忽略了区间乘2可能作用于中间元素的多种情况。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-11c9647dca18b1c8953d3725e54e2230</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;(A[N] - A[1]) * 2&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FORMULA"</data>
      <data key="d1">"(a[n] - a[1]) * 2 是学生程序中另一个错误公式，假设极差翻倍即为最优，但该假设未考虑乘2操作对极差的非线性影响。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-11c9647dca18b1c8953d3725e54e2230</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">Program Segment 1/2 is the first and only visible portion of a student’s submitted C++ code for a programming competition problem requiring the transformation of a binary 01 matrix into a “好矩阵” (good matrix), also known as a “双生数组” (twin array)—a structure in which all '1's are concentrated in the top-left quadrant. The submission demonstrates ambitious and conceptually rich algorithmic thinking, reflecting a deep engagement with combinatorial optimization and an aspiration to realize the aesthetic ideal of “数值膨胀之美” (beauty of numerical expansion).

The code reads an input binary matrix and attempts to relocate all '1's to the target top-left quadrant through adjacent element swaps, guided by a greedy algorithm. It employs advanced C++ data structures such as `vector` and `map`, and integrates multiple sophisticated algorithmic paradigms, including sorting, median calculation, element pairing, prefix/suffix minimum arrays, and a double-pointer sliding window technique. The implementation includes detailed logging of swap operations, random number generation, string construction, validation logic, and coordinate tracking variables `cnti` and `cntj` intended to direct the movement of '1's via nested loops. Key functions such as `solve()` and `query()` are present, encompassing the core logic for input, processing, and output.

Although the code superficially resembles solutions to problems involving diagonal sum precomputation—such as the “Dragon’s Breath” problem—the core objective is not range query optimization or diagonal summation, but rather matrix reorganization. References to diagonal sums appear to be a conceptual misattribution or overlap and do not form part of the actual algorithmic intent.

Despite its structural complexity and innovative design, Program Segment 1/2 contains critical logical and syntactic flaws that prevent correct execution. These include a disordered (`紊乱`) update mechanism for `cnti` and `cntj`, improperly sequenced swap operations, flawed loop termination conditions, and inconsistencies in the median-based and sorting components designed to construct a valid twin array. As a result, the algorithm fails to reliably position all '1's in the top-left quadrant, leading to incomplete or incorrect matrix transformation.

The submission was graded 40/100, reflecting both its creative ambition and significant gaps in implementation logic, control flow management, and error handling. While the code showcases a strong theoretical understanding and technical aspiration, its practical execution remains fundamentally flawed, rendering it non-functional as a</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c2a57305752e3a687103dd58dbee53bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa783b90d0126e6fe65518c125bef47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de530eec1b33d2199269b22b88bb1c32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66aa472cb9a249d5511f69ff4cdc9520&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8639879bd177c95139010b9025b24c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec34f58c7576beef3e1ee627c114a25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeffa4db6e2444dac981d2f6e46c8e68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad8afc7ac300d86b72e962805041fa5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c5bdeaa2e5f505a00838eed99bce2dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d45a376c5f8e29b656fb8024a9e1fab6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a0e68ffe11c5d605b2d172bc117a660&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24e91156da41d8c127cfcd98fd99217c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47e1da39547e4d5d5cdafb2530c061c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46766da85f9f13835e435950173174a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5e545f02779dfb717361dfc31cb72c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bbc06444b81cde07bd3f70e96886225&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0e2ac3fe25900f76cfe73eedcd9570d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3eac5a8ba5cac7de40889ced9fb5315&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f089790696661ee6abceff90f9924d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f83dfef3345c73ed407093c9749130b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c02916b7b0e5a87f92d544844a99ec6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8796025571904280b91872c5eb3f6610&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-504efc1d29aab22b90705499f57173fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0be1ff21d6f00384f294e712dc03c7a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Error Description documents the evaluation outcome of the student’s program, indicating partial correctness with a score of 18.75, revealing logical or edge-case flaws in the implementation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Error Description is the feedback provided on the student's program, indicating partial correctness with a score of 18.75, highlighting that the solution contains logical or implementation flaws despite partial functionality."&lt;SEP&gt;The ERROR DESCRIPTION refers to a formal, persistent, and systematically documented pattern of algorithmic failures in student submissions related to the incorrect implementation of a matrix-based algorithm designed to transform an input array into a 双生数组 (twin array), also known as a “好矩阵” (good matrix), as defined by the problem specification. This is not an isolated bug but a recurring deficiency observed across multiple evaluation runs between January 21 and January 23, 2025, with official assessment IDs including 51-2, 53-2, 37-2, 46-2, 49-2, 50-1 (logged between January 21, 2025, 17:41:02 and 17:46:24), as well as later instances on January 23, 2025, at 13:47:29 (ID 61-1) and 13:49:22 (ID 62-1). The error was formally logged as an event on February 6, 2025, at 14:03:57 (ID 80-1), and further documented on February 8, 2025, at multiple timestamps: 14:10:09 (ID 95-1), 14:13:08 (ID 95-1), 15:18:42 (ID 98-1), 15:49:29 (ID 99-1), 15:49:29 (ID 99-2), and 16:06:57 (ID 101-1), with an additional specific instance recorded on February 8, 2025, at 16:27:58 (Record ID 104-1). An earlier instance was also recorded on February 8, 2025, with ID 105-1, confirming the consistency of the error across time and submissions.

The core issue lies in the student’s program attempting to restructure the input array by relocating '1's to achieve a balanced and paired configuration in the top-left quadrant—a structural requirement for a valid</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-985dca88cf19334aa6bccf195ded5fbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d887a2fa6fff76122dbcba92f32c0d9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de530eec1b33d2199269b22b88bb1c32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec34f58c7576beef3e1ee627c114a25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e118fc6033f61b8968a68a6cbe21cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d45a376c5f8e29b656fb8024a9e1fab6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47e1da39547e4d5d5cdafb2530c061c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f02234c0d5217769809ae214a58779b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bcd1771d7e55d80f714bbc3d88370bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70a2665d10418a7ca4b53ae850057cff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d855de4fc3c8066acae7529422e672d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f089790696661ee6abceff90f9924d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f83dfef3345c73ed407093c9749130b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8796025571904280b91872c5eb3f6610&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1446a315ea545061645e2e34bdaaffae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0be1ff21d6f00384f294e712dc03c7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d2aa75d8324c591292a5206cbd69bde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fbb166f8ec0a1178f2d878ecaab5e98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ae1fc917022eddc74e2fec3c8d34bb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44c8edff064a63bf1c338d7c234b2385&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d58149e2705f5337a0bc1e192ab33a56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad8afc7ac300d86b72e962805041fa5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-412f096b4887f07bc254759a350f79a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180c6e0fe94889fc71026468d48a172f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-264071873a8220efc52cdb3c6f973f1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6d92f893d17f47848e169766c22b284&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8571d78ef0982dfe0d6ef86e585cbe98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe255a1fe76c6cdfb705f9ea60c587de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31863a3502540c31035499a1b63c97c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4815d1a22ec8a935241a5f566cd9c42f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bbc06444b81cde07bd3f70e96886225&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e091fd25a6ba2509fa168c85c52636ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13a9ab5634b62de5516cbb77c8616b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3eac5a8ba5cac7de40889ced9fb5315&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7230c75a37c25448800f6f28d89050f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c02916b7b0e5a87f92d544844a99ec6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c79d0a874a6ba47efd4742ec70c1e196&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2a57305752e3a687103dd58dbee53bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5df2edc3d03ec6c5e1b9a6d2ff7905f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0b936b6b647a37d956fdf66cd57a12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c04c2481dfa06e8cc96fafb3eb40ca4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2ac191ac64f16e456c655d4b8863811&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47baadad1b80a9eb7ea15b9cd824968b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa783b90d0126e6fe65518c125bef47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fa52e5b330629e1cee02304480f542&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66aa472cb9a249d5511f69ff4cdc9520&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fe6cf8d6835af29afa5ade64370e360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8639879bd177c95139010b9025b24c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeffa4db6e2444dac981d2f6e46c8e68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c5bdeaa2e5f505a00838eed99bce2dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a0e68ffe11c5d605b2d172bc117a660&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46766da85f9f13835e435950173174a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7effc3a8936d5e21e04e38b0253505c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79af8c07e093eeaf2a8b54738698e7af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffffe6b4389bb3df97140e17e088aa9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f831b89c29a24b6f937f910e69eb76a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e307f6e0f75e0c72f6c263b74efaa1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-877df4ea12833328944aec827f97328b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-504efc1d29aab22b90705499f57173fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c43422d516179991d5c796063c71f443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56cf64b248d90f79e1afa9d0cd84c04a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4655c44a0c410e0c718d92b308d741b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2c34d00a1cb1d7916cefb78fbc43896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d7c8c700f1653b2de9c2e270fef6e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca7b7c2c9549b0f15b3ed9c255cd57c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24e91156da41d8c127cfcd98fd99217c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5e545f02779dfb717361dfc31cb72c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb748d740807dc942d42a2dc4f25d05d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d300103154c5f70514a4d86cc50a94df</data>
