    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RECORD ID: 39-2&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Record ID: 39-2 is a system log entry documenting the submission of the flawed student program on 2025-01-21 16:28:29, indicating a partial correctness score of 40.0."</data>
