    <node id="&quot;VIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A 2D boolean array used to track visited cells during BFS traversal to prevent reprocessing and cycles."&lt;SEP&gt;"A 2D boolean array used to track visited cells during BFS traversal to prevent reprocessing and ensure correctness."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vis is a 2D array used to track visited cells in the BFS algorithm, acting as a state management system for the traversal process."&lt;SEP&gt;"vis 是学生程序中用于标记字符是否已出现的布尔数组，用于辅助计算最长匹配长度，但其使用逻辑有误。"&lt;SEP&gt;"vis 是学生程序中用于标记字符是否已出现的布尔数组，用于计算最长重复字符位置，是算法逻辑的一部分。"</data>
