    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOLVE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A function that initializes the grid, runs BFS on all unvisited 1-cells, and outputs the minimum surrounding 0-cells for the largest connected component."&lt;SEP&gt;"solve是学生程序中的核心函数，封装了判断是否存在满足条件字符串的逻辑，包含输入处理、条件判断和字符串构造。"&lt;SEP&gt;"solve is a function in the student's program that computes a mathematical expression involving intervals [a,b] to estimate expected absolute differences, forming a core computational building block."&lt;SEP&gt;"solve is a helper function in the student program that computes a mathematical expression involving ranges a and b to estimate expected absolute differences under uniform distribution, but contains a flawed formula."&lt;SEP&gt;"solve is a core function in the student program that computes the expected absolute difference between two independent uniform random variables over integer intervals using modular arithmetic."&lt;SEP&gt;"solve is a function called in the student program to process each test case, representing the core computational task of answering the permutation queries as defined in the problem statement."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d58149e2705f5337a0bc1e192ab33a56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f207867e95527d1c21eb90640d585ef3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3</data>
    </node>
