    <node id="&quot;F&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A boolean flag variable used in the code to indicate whether any element in a row or column exceeds the value of 1; its state determines subsequent logic flow."&lt;SEP&gt;"A boolean flag variable used in the code to track whether any element in a row or column exceeds the value of 1, influencing the logic for determining correctness."&lt;SEP&gt;"A boolean flag variable used in the code to track whether any element in a row or column exceeds the value of 1, influencing the state of other variables like cnt and flag."&lt;SEP&gt;"F is a 2D map structure tracking whether a cell with value 0 has been counted as a boundary-adjacent cell during BFS traversal."&lt;SEP&gt;"f 是学生程序中用于记录字符首次出现的哈希映射，用于判断字符重复，是计算子序列匹配的关键数据结构。"&lt;SEP&gt;"f 是学生程序中用于记录字符首次出现情况的 map，用于辅助判断字符重复性，是计算可爱度的中间结构。"</data>
