    <node id="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that destroys monsters along diagonal lines extending from a selected coordinate (x,y) in four directions: (x-1,y-1), (x-1,y+1), (x+1,y-1), (x+1,y+1), forming an 'X' pattern."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that destroys monsters along diagonal lines extending from a targeted coordinate (x,y) in four directions: (x-1,y-1), (x-1,y+1), (x+1,y-1), (x+1,y+1), forming an 'X' shape across the grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that releases flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters on diagonal paths from a selected coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that releases flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters on diagonal paths from a selected coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special attack that releases flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters on diagonal paths from a chosen coordinate (x,y) and extending to (x±1,y±1)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that releases flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters on diagonal paths from a selected coordinate."</data>
