      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Grid Map is an n-row by m-column rectangular grid where each cell (i,j) contains a number of monsters denoted by a_{i,j}, and the Dragon's Breath attack is applied upon this spatial structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map is an n-row by m-column rectangular grid where each cell (i,j) contains a number of monsters represented by a_{i,j}, and the Dragon's Breath ability affects diagonal lines across this grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"The grid map is an n-row by m-column rectangular grid where each cell (i,j) contains a number of monsters represented by a_{i,j}. It is the battlefield where Dragon's Breath is deployed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map is an n-row by m-column rectangular grid where each cell (i,j) contains a_{i,j} monsters, and the Dragon's Breath ability is applied to maximize monster elimination across this spatial structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The grid map is an n-row by m-column rectangular grid where each cell (i,j) contains a number of monsters denoted by a_{i,j}, and is the battlefield for the Dragon's Breath ability."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map is an n-row by m-column rectangular grid where each cell (i,j) contains a_{i,j} monsters, and the Dragon's Breath ability is applied to this spatial structure."</data>
