    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;回文&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 uses the concept of '回文' as the core criterion for determining whether an array is '好数组', establishing a direct conceptual dependency."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红定义了‘回文’作为判断‘好数组’的基础概念，是该数学性质的提出者。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7ca5047ad2314016a91534ae51d7d7e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e9ce81e31f65b60ba40e243a8d1ba19</data>
