    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;行列式构造问题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">45.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 is the person who initiated the行列式构造问题 by requesting the construction of a specific 3x3 determinant."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红是提出行列式构造问题的主体，该事件由她发起并要求他人解决。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红是行列式构造问题的提出者，她希望他人帮助解决这一数学构造问题。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红是行列式构造问题的提出者，她希望他人帮助解决这个数学问题。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dc7738af741f87817ecb754f66dfca01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72507ce11e78cbb0f5fe85180ed22a32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9765d69bafc102e4cf79f177abd37634&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab09dc98572215fda28e7c7cb77d448&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e8103be36cfb2447eeee275964beaf1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;X&quot;">
      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 explicitly requires the determinant's value to equal x, making x the central target variable of her constructed problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红在问题中明确要求行列式的值等于 x，因此 x 是她所定义问题的核心约束条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红需要根据x的值判断最小花费策略，x是其评估结果的关键变量。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-468ecda2a7ffd84f7956eab9b179bd56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e8103be36cfb2447eeee275964beaf1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;CHINA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">26.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 is likely a student in a Chinese educational context, as indicated by the Chinese-language problem statement and typical academic formatting."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红是中文语境下的学生，该问题来源于中国教育体系的数学练习场景。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红使用中文提问，表明其身处中文教育环境，与中国教育体系相关。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is likely located in China, given the Chinese-language context of the problem and student submission."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-122f34a10a694b4546099c481788102d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc7738af741f87817ecb754f66dfca01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72507ce11e78cbb0f5fe85180ed22a32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9765d69bafc102e4cf79f177abd37634</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;3阶行列式构造问题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 is the person who initiated or posed the 3阶行列式构造问题, making her the originator of the task."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the person who initiated the 3阶行列式构造问题 by requesting a matrix construction with specific constraints."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the person who initiated the 3阶行列式构造问题 by requesting a matrix construction with specific constraints."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f0c9c6802989382170739955a5bae46c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbb70ce68f01832942dce770ad4d1320&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb726f40228a938cab23f8ee251f3349</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">220.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 is the problem author who defined the '好矩阵' requirement, and the Student Program is an attempted solution to her problem, which fails due to algorithmic errors."&lt;SEP&gt;The "Student Program" is an attempted solution developed in direct response to a computational problem defined and set by 小红, who is the problem designer and originator of the challenge to transform a given matrix into a “好矩阵” (good matrix) through adjacent swaps. 小红’s specification, which centers on a determinant-based or matrix transformation algorithm, serves as the explicit target for the Student Program’s implementation. The program was created with the intention of automating this transformation and fulfilling 小红’s defined requirements, establishing a clear relationship between her as the problem setter and the program as the attempted solution.

Despite this direct alignment with 小红’s problem statement, the Student Program contains critical logical flaws and implementation errors that prevent it from correctly achieving the required matrix transformation. As a result, it fails to meet the specified criteria for producing a “好矩阵,” and thus does not successfully resolve the challenge 小红 posed. Although the program falls short of its intended goal, its purpose and design remain unequivocally tied to 小红’s original problem — she is both the source of the challenge and the intended beneficiary of its solution. In summary, 小红 is the authoritative definier of the “好矩阵” standard, and the Student Program is a flawed but direct implementation attempt to realize her algorithmic vision.</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-0b0b936b6b647a37d956fdf66cd57a12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2ac191ac64f16e456c655d4b8863811&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-985dca88cf19334aa6bccf195ded5fbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47baadad1b80a9eb7ea15b9cd824968b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44c8edff064a63bf1c338d7c234b2385&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66aa472cb9a249d5511f69ff4cdc9520&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35ba454db150409dfa2569afe0680c61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d7c8c700f1653b2de9c2e270fef6e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb726f40228a938cab23f8ee251f3349&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fe6cf8d6835af29afa5ade64370e360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8639879bd177c95139010b9025b24c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec34f58c7576beef3e1ee627c114a25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeffa4db6e2444dac981d2f6e46c8e68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24e91156da41d8c127cfcd98fd99217c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47e1da39547e4d5d5cdafb2530c061c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-264071873a8220efc52cdb3c6f973f1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46766da85f9f13835e435950173174a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e091fd25a6ba2509fa168c85c52636ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3eac5a8ba5cac7de40889ced9fb5315&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f089790696661ee6abceff90f9924d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-122f34a10a694b4546099c481788102d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c02916b7b0e5a87f92d544844a99ec6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8796025571904280b91872c5eb3f6610&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0c9c6802989382170739955a5bae46c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbb70ce68f01832942dce770ad4d1320&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d300103154c5f70514a4d86cc50a94df</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
