      <data key="d3">23.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"M defines the memory allocation size for the array a[], ensuring the student program can handle maximum input constraints."&lt;SEP&gt;"M的定义确保程序能处理最大规模输入，是程序鲁棒性的工程实现。"&lt;SEP&gt;"学生程序 uses M = 1e5 + 7 as a memory boundary to declare the array size, defining the maximum problem scale the program can handle."</data>
