      <data key="d3">33.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"This optimization is part of the student program's performance tuning for competitive programming environments."&lt;SEP&gt;"学生程序采用std::ios::sync_with_stdio(false)以优化I/O性能，说明其对运行效率有明确要求。"&lt;SEP&gt;"该语句优化输入输出性能，反映学生在编程竞赛中对效率的追求。"&lt;SEP&gt;"学生程序 enables faster I/O with std::ios::sync_with_stdio(false), a common optimization in competitive programming to handle large inputs efficiently."&lt;SEP&gt;"学生程序 includes std::ios::sync_with_stdio(false) as an optimization event to accelerate input reading, critical for handling large test cases efficiently."</data>
