    <edge source="&quot;好数组&quot;" target="&quot;回文数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">39.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"‘好数组’的定义建立在‘回文数组’的基础上：必须非回文但能通过单次修改变为回文，二者互为对立与转化关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"好数组必须非回文但可单次修改为回文，二者构成逻辑上的互补与转化关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"好数组的定义依赖于回文数组的性质，必须满足非回文但可经单元素修改成为回文数组的条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"好数组的定义以‘不是回文数组’为前提，但可通过修改一个元素变为回文数组，二者构成逻辑上的对立与转化关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-934cc7b3a877cbd7ad4ae67d1ccb33c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79d7d963b8a058798cc18c9a690fc98e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccb93b3d8dd3d7a52c8db5aa7be12e9f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;好数组&quot;" target="&quot;N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"好数组的计算范围依赖于数组总长度n，n决定了可提取的子数组总数。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ccb93b3d8dd3d7a52c8db5aa7be12e9f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;好数组&quot;" target="&quot;K&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"好数组的定义明确限定为长度为k的子数组，k是其存在的必要条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ccb93b3d8dd3d7a52c8db5aa7be12e9f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;好数组&quot;" target="&quot;CNT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variable cnt is used in the Student Program to determine whether a subarray qualifies as a '好数组' by counting mismatches; the logic here directly defines the correctness of the event detection."&lt;SEP&gt;"cnt is the key variable used in the student program to determine if a subarray qualifies as a '好数组' by counting mismatches."&lt;SEP&gt;"好数组的判定要求cnt恰好为1，cnt是其核心判断依据。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d4818f978c53c37b43ca5128a7e29f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccb93b3d8dd3d7a52c8db5aa7be12e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-934cc7b3a877cbd7ad4ae67d1ccb33c0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;好数组&quot;" target="&quot;ANS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variable ans accumulates the total number of subarrays classified as '好数组' by the program, making it the quantitative output of the event."&lt;SEP&gt;"ans accumulates the total count of subarrays identified as '好数组' by the student program’s logic."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d4818f978c53c37b43ca5128a7e29f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-934cc7b3a877cbd7ad4ae67d1ccb33c0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;好数组&quot;" target="&quot;FOR(INT I = 0; I &lt;= K / 2; ++ I)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"This loop implements the core logic to check if a subarray can become a palindrome with one modification, directly determining '好数组' status."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-934cc7b3a877cbd7ad4ae67d1ccb33c0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;好数组&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program attempts to compute the number of '好数组' in a given array, directly relating to the defined event, but contains a bug in its implementation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d4818f978c53c37b43ca5128a7e29f6</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;好数组&quot;" target="&quot;长度为K的连续子数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"好数组的定义完全依赖于长度为k的连续子数组是否满足非回文但可单元素修正为回文的条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-79d7d963b8a058798cc18c9a690fc98e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;回文数组&quot;" target="&quot;L&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"回文数组的判断依赖于从位置l开始的子数组的对称性比较，l是其检测的起始点。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ccb93b3d8dd3d7a52c8db5aa7be12e9f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;回文数组&quot;" target="&quot;R&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"回文数组的判断依赖于从位置r结束的子数组的对称性比较，r是其检测的终点。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ccb93b3d8dd3d7a52c8db5aa7be12e9f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;回文数组&quot;" target="&quot;CNT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"回文数组的判断通过cnt是否为0来确定，cnt是其判定的量化指标。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ccb93b3d8dd3d7a52c8db5aa7be12e9f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;回文数组&quot;" target="&quot;长度为K的连续子数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"好数组的判断依赖于长度为k的连续子数组是否满足'非回文但可通过修改一个元素变为回文'的条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"长度为k的连续子数组 is evaluated against the definition of 回文数组 to determine if modifying one element can make it palindromic."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ff1c9451165769991bdb3906da8d57d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e3f9d595e0b4dc6b94e1564563f7ded</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;回文数组&quot;" target="&quot;1E5 + 7&quot;">
      <data key="d3">5.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The constraint of 1e5 + 7 defines the maximum possible array length, which indirectly limits the size of any potential palindrome array that the algorithm must evaluate."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ff1c9451165769991bdb3906da8d57d8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;回文数组&quot;" target="&quot;对称位置比较&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"对称位置比较是判断一个数组是否为回文数组的核心方法，通过逐对比较实现。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4df85ce295d523e4b50f09ff04d5c7bc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;回文数组&quot;" target="&quot;FOR(INT I = 0; I &lt;= K / 2; ++ I)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The loop compares symmetric positions to verify if a subarray matches the definition of a palindrome array."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-934cc7b3a877cbd7ad4ae67d1ccb33c0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;回文数组&quot;" target="&quot;数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"回文数组是数组的一种特殊形式，通过左右翻转判断是否相等，是判断‘好数组’的前提条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"数组是回文数组的载体，回文数组是数组的一种特殊形态，满足反转后不变的性质。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7ca5047ad2314016a91534ae51d7d7e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79d7d963b8a058798cc18c9a690fc98e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;回文数组&quot;" target="&quot;连续子数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"每个连续子数组需被检测是否为回文数组，以判断其是否符合‘好数组’的第二重条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7ca5047ad2314016a91534ae51d7d7e9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;回文数组&quot;" target="&quot;CNT == 1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"回文数组's definition is computationally tested via cnt == 1, which counts mismatches in symmetric positions to determine if exactly one change can create a palindrome."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8e3f9d595e0b4dc6b94e1564563f7ded</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;中国&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">113.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program is written in C++ using Chinese-language problem context and follows the conventions of Chinese programming competitions, indicating its cultural and educational origin in China."&lt;SEP&gt;The Student Program is a C++-based software development project written within the cultural, educational, and competitive programming ecosystem of China. It exhibits distinctive characteristics of Chinese algorithmic training environments, including the use of Chinese-language problem statements, Chinese variable names, and coding conventions standard in Chinese programming competitions such as NOI (National Olympiad in Informatics) and ICPC (International Collegiate Programming Contest). These conventions include the use of #define int long long for performance optimization, #include&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt; as a universal header, std::ios::sync_with_stdio for faster I/O, and 1-indexed array usage—practices deeply embedded in China’s Olympiad in Informatics (OI) culture. The program’s structure, syntax, and naming patterns reflect its origin in Chinese academic institutions and its intended use within Chinese online judges (OJs) and competition training systems. All evidence consistently indicates that the Student Program was developed by a student or educator in China, likely as part of a national or regional programming competition or algorithmic education curriculum, confirming its deep integration into China’s competitive programming infrastructure.</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2c34d00a1cb1d7916cefb78fbc43896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f089790696661ee6abceff90f9924d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c9647dca18b1c8953d3725e54e2230&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6dde8d5dace842a3db295bc3a2b69c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8796025571904280b91872c5eb3f6610&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2ac191ac64f16e456c655d4b8863811&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeffa4db6e2444dac981d2f6e46c8e68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-412f096b4887f07bc254759a350f79a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab09dc98572215fda28e7c7cb77d448&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a0e68ffe11c5d605b2d172bc117a660&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24e91156da41d8c127cfcd98fd99217c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b590abbdea60c545ca54c73ea12cc6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
