      <data key="d4">"《小鸡的排列构造》 is presented in Chinese and follows the style of Chinese programming competitions, indicating its origin in China’s competitive programming ecosystem."&lt;SEP&gt;"《小鸡的排列构造》is a problem presented in Chinese with typical Chinese OI (Olympiad in Informatics) problem formatting, indicating its origin and context within China’s competitive programming ecosystem."&lt;SEP&gt;"《小鸡的排列构造》is a Chinese-language competitive programming problem, consistent with the context of Chinese programming contests such as NOI or CCF, implying its origin in China."</data>
