    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;K&quot;">
      <data key="d3">23.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Variable 'n' defines the upper bound for loop variable 'k', controlling the scope of matrix traversal in the algorithm."&lt;SEP&gt;"n and k are input parameters where k must be ≤ n for the problem to be valid, establishing a mathematical dependency between them."&lt;SEP&gt;"Variable 'n' defines the upper bound for loop variable 'k', determining the scope of matrix traversal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-934cc7b3a877cbd7ad4ae67d1ccb33c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13a9ab5634b62de5516cbb77c8616b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffffe6b4389bb3df97140e17e088aa9b</data>
