    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;井然有序之窗&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"井然有序之窗”作为问题主题，其核心是构造长度为 n 的排列，n 是其规模定义。"&lt;SEP&gt;"井然有序之窗问题的规模由 n 决定，n 是构造排列长度的必需参数。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e99c195bf139756748ff95a63861cbef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab26ec20fcd79dc385eb33e508c23dea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n defines the number of constraints [l_i, r_i], each corresponding to a position in the permutation; the validity of the solution depends on n matching the number of intervals provided."&lt;SEP&gt;"n is the count of intervals [l_i, r_i], one for each element in the sequence, making it structurally linked to the range definitions."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b590abbdea60c545ca54c73ea12cc6b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;1 ~ N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n determines the upper bound of the value domain 1 ~ n, ensuring the permutation contains exactly the integers from 1 to n without repetition."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1b590abbdea60c545ca54c73ea12cc6b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;排列&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
