      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n determines the size of the array a[], which holds the n integers to be processed. The value of n directly controls the input scope of the problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
