    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;BFS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">25.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The BFS algorithm operates on a grid of size n x m, where n defines the number of rows."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BFS algorithm uses the variable n to determine the vertical bounds of the grid during traversal."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BFS algorithm uses N as a boundary constraint to validate grid coordinates during traversal."</data>
