    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;字符串外串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">61.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n 作为字符串长度参数，是‘字符串外串’事件中必须满足的输入约束条件，决定了问题解空间的大小。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n 作为输入参数，是‘字符串外串’事件中构造字符串的长度约束条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n 是‘字符串外串’事件中必须输入的参数，决定字符串构造的规模。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n 是‘字符串外串’事件中的关键输入参数，用于确定字符串长度约束。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n 是‘字符串外串’问题的输入参数之一，用于限定字符串长度，决定问题是否存在解。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n 是‘字符串外串’问题中的输入参数，决定字符串长度，直接影响问题可解性。"&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串题目要求针对任意给定 n 和 m 判断是否存在符合条件的字符串 t."&lt;SEP&gt;"n 是‘字符串外串’问题的输入参数，决定字符串长度，是问题求解的约束条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-67a35ea6ed4e42eb7c4874b218ee041d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-435d0b64fef9c51a64d020305df4c4a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f71a436c68bda6c051ade04f84d6c77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca7b7c2c9549b0f15b3ed9c255cd57c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd5a87d368619780b9c83a36a26e8d95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8571d78ef0982dfe0d6ef86e585cbe98</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">60.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program 接收 n 作为输入，但错误使用 rand() 生成其值，导致输入不符合题目指定的确定性要求。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 接收 n 作为输入，用于判断和构造长度为 n 的字符串。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 接收n作为输入参数，并基于n生成字符串，体现其对输入的依赖。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 接收 n 作为输入，试图构造长度为 n 的字符串，但其随机生成逻辑导致参数无效。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 接收 n 作为输入，用于判断字符串长度是否满足条件，但其逻辑在 n &lt;= m 时错误地返回 NO，未考虑构造可能。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n defines the sequence length that the Student Program iterates over, from i=2 to n, to accumulate the total expected value of val(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"n defines the size of the sequence, which determines how many times the query function is called in the main loop of the Student Program."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program takes n as input to begin its BFS search for reaching m, making n a critical parameter of the algorithm."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5df2edc3d03ec6c5e1b9a6d2ff7905f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f71a436c68bda6c051ade04f84d6c77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca7b7c2c9549b0f15b3ed9c255cd57c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;CNT = 2 * M - N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n 是计算 cnt 的关键输入变量，cnt = 2*m - n 依赖 n 的值决定中间 'a' 的数量。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;牛可乐&quot;">
      <data key="d3">55.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"牛可乐 defines the problem in terms of parameters n and m, where n is the length of the string to be constructed."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐在问题中定义了 n 作为字符串长度的输入参数，是问题约束的核心变量。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐在问题中设定n作为字符串长度的输入参数，是问题约束的一部分。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐在题目中定义了参数 n 作为字符串长度的输入，是可爱度问题的核心变量之一。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐在问题中设定了 n 作为字符串长度的输入变量，体现其对问题结构的控制。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐在题目中定义了参数 n 作为字符串长度的输入变量，是‘可爱度’计算的基础条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 defines the problem where n is a critical input parameter determining the length of string t."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-67a35ea6ed4e42eb7c4874b218ee041d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79af8c07e093eeaf2a8b54738698e7af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cb4bd7875d45de235db605ada816662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca7b7c2c9549b0f15b3ed9c255cd57c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8571d78ef0982dfe0d6ef86e585cbe98</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">135.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n and m are the start and target states in the transformation problem, with the entire operation set defined to determine reachability from n to m."&lt;SEP&gt;"n and m together define the dimensions of the 2D array a, establishing the spatial boundaries for all diagonal traversals and computations."&lt;SEP&gt;The entities "M" and "N" are paired input parameters in a problem that requires determining whether a string of length N exists with a specified "cuteness" value M. The existence of such a string is strictly governed by mathematical and logical constraints derived from the relationship between N and M. Specifically, a solution is only possible when N &gt; M, as the cute value M cannot exceed or equal the string length N—this is due to the structural requirement that a string’s cute度 (cuteness) arises from non-overlapping or segmented subsequences, which necessitates at least two distinct segments, making M = N or M &gt; N impossible. Additionally, the difference N - M must not exceed 26, as this upper bound corresponds to the size of the English alphabet; exceeding this limit would require more distinct character transitions or patterns than available unique letters can support. Consequently, the problem’s solvability is determined by the dual constraints: N &gt; M and N - M ≤ 26. These conditions form the core判定逻辑 (decision logic) in program implementations, where violations of either constraint immediately render the problem unsolvable. All provided descriptions consistently affirm this dual-bound constraint, resolving any minor phrasing differences into a unified understanding: the parameters N and M are interdependent, and their numerical relationship directly defines the feasibility of constructing a valid string.&lt;SEP&gt;"n和m是运算的输入与输出目标，二者构成问题的核心转换关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-435d0b64fef9c51a64d020305df4c4a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5df2edc3d03ec6c5e1b9a6d2ff7905f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f71a436c68bda6c051ade04f84d6c77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cb4bd7875d45de235db605ada816662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2da9ecfa854ec125c90cf41bc3e549e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180c6e0fe94889fc71026468d48a172f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd5a87d368619780b9c83a36a26e8d95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;可爱度&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"可爱度m必须小于n，因为子串和子序列均需从长度为n的字符串中提取，存在数学约束关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8cb4bd7875d45de235db605ada816662</data>
