    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">35.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Grid Map has n rows, defining its vertical dimension and constraining valid row indices for Dragon's Breath."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map has n rows, defining its vertical size and constraining where Dragon's Breath can propagate."&lt;SEP&gt;"n defines the number of rows in the Grid Map, establishing its vertical size and boundaries for Dragon's Breath propagation."&lt;SEP&gt;"n defines the number of rows in the Grid Map, establishing its vertical dimension."</data>
