    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">23.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"i iterates up to m, while u is initialized to n, indicating n and i define the starting points of different diagonal sweeps in the algorithm."&lt;SEP&gt;"i iterates up to n; if n is zero or negative, the loop may not execute or cause undefined behavior."&lt;SEP&gt;"n bounds the iteration of i, defining the vertical extent of the matrix traversal."</data>
