    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;A&quot;">
      <data key="d3">33.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The value of 'n' defines the number of bits in binary number 'a', establishing its size and scope."&lt;SEP&gt;"n defines the row bounds for array 'a'; if n is zero or undefined, loops using 'n' cause invalid memory access."&lt;SEP&gt;"n定义了a的位数，决定了a的状态空间和可操作位的数量，是a的结构基础。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The variable n defines the size of the 2D array a, determining the bounds of iteration loops that access a."</data>
