      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variable cnt is central to the Student Program's logic for determining if a subarray is a '好数组', but its implementation incorrectly counts mismatches by including the center element in odd-length arrays, leading to errors."&lt;SEP&gt;"cnt 是 Student Program 中用于控制重复字符数量的变量，但其计算方式 min(0ll, 2*m - n) 错误，导致构造失败。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d4818f978c53c37b43ca5128a7e29f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f71a436c68bda6c051ade04f84d6c77</data>
