    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;行列式构造问题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">40.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program is the attempted solution to the行列式构造问题, though it contains logical errors and does not correctly solve the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 是为解决行列式构造问题而编写的程序，但其算法存在缺陷，未能正确实现要求。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 是对行列式构造问题的编程尝试，试图自动化生成满足条件的行列式，但存在逻辑缺陷导致错误。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program是针对行列式构造问题的解答尝试，但存在逻辑错误，未能正确满足所有情况的约束条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 是对行列式构造问题的解答尝试，但因逻辑错误未能正确满足条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dc7738af741f87817ecb754f66dfca01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72507ce11e78cbb0f5fe85180ed22a32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9765d69bafc102e4cf79f177abd37634&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab09dc98572215fda28e7c7cb77d448&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e8103be36cfb2447eeee275964beaf1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;X&quot;">
      <data key="d3">54.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program 接收 x 作为输入，并试图通过算法计算矩阵元素使行列式值等于 x，但其逻辑在处理整数除法和边界条件时存在错误。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program takes x as input and attempts to compute matrix elements such that the determinant equals x, making x the critical parameter driving the program's logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to compute and assign a value to e based on x, directly linking the input variable x to the determinant’s final value through algorithmic logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program takes x as input and attempts to compute matrix elements such that the determinant equals x, making x central to the program's logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"x is the input to the Student Program, which is meant to determine the matrix elements, but the program’s logic for computing e from x is flawed and inconsistent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 的算法旨在根据输入变量 x 构造满足条件的行列式，x 是程序计算输出的直接目标。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-35ba454db150409dfa2569afe0680c61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc7738af741f87817ecb754f66dfca01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-122f34a10a694b4546099c481788102d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9765d69bafc102e4cf79f177abd37634&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e8103be36cfb2447eeee275964beaf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbb70ce68f01832942dce770ad4d1320</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">31.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"1 is repeatedly used in the Student Program to satisfy the absolute value ≥1 constraint for matrix elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The constant value 1 is hard-coded multiple times in the student program as matrix elements, reflecting a rigid design that fails to adapt to arbitrary x values."&lt;SEP&gt;"The integer '1' is a hardcoded element in the student program's matrix, used to satisfy the absolute value constraint and simplify construction."&lt;SEP&gt;"The constant value 1 is hard-coded in multiple positions of the student’s matrix within the program, forming the structural basis of the solution but contributing to its inflexibility."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-72507ce11e78cbb0f5fe85180ed22a32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab09dc98572215fda28e7c7cb77d448&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbb70ce68f01832942dce770ad4d1320&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb726f40228a938cab23f8ee251f3349</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;-1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">21.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The constant value -1 is used in the student program's matrix, contributing to determinant calculation but potentially causing errors when combined with other fixed values for arbitrary x."&lt;SEP&gt;"The integer '-1' is hardcoded in the student program's matrix to help adjust the determinant’s sign and magnitude toward the target x."&lt;SEP&gt;"The constant value -1 is used in the student’s matrix to help control determinant sign, but its fixed use without adjustment for x leads to incorrect results for many inputs."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-72507ce11e78cbb0f5fe85180ed22a32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab09dc98572215fda28e7c7cb77d448&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbb70ce68f01832942dce770ad4d1320</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">22.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The constant value 2 is embedded in the student program as a fixed matrix element, limiting the program's flexibility to adjust the determinant value dynamically."&lt;SEP&gt;"The integer '2' is a fixed matrix element (c) in the student program, deliberately chosen to contribute to the determinant's computed value."&lt;SEP&gt;"The constant value 2 is fixed in the matrix (element c), making the program unable to adapt the determinant to arbitrary x values, which is a core flaw."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-72507ce11e78cbb0f5fe85180ed22a32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab09dc98572215fda28e7c7cb77d448&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbb70ce68f01832942dce770ad4d1320</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
