    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">123.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 is a component of the Student Program, representing the core algorithmic logic that contains the error."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is the actual code component of the Student Program, representing its implementation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 由 Program Segment 1/2 这一具体代码片段实现，是其唯一可见的技术表达形式。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is the actual implementation within the Student Program that contains the erroneous algorithm for matrix transformation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is a core part of the Student Program, containing the main algorithmic logic that is flawed and leads to the error."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 由 Program Segment 1/2 构成，是该程序的主体实现部分，描述了核心算法逻辑。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is the concrete implementation of the Student Program, representing the actual code that was submitted and evaluated."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is the core component of the Student Program, containing the algorithmic logic that constitutes the student's solution attempt."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is a constituent part of the larger Student Program, showing the core logic for matrix manipulation and adjacent swaps."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 是 Student Program 的核心代码实现，包含了所有错误逻辑与验证机制。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 是 Student Program 的具体代码实现部分，构成其核心逻辑，二者是整体与组成部分的关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is a component of the larger Student Program, representing the incomplete code submission that contains the erroneous logic for matrix transformation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is a constituent part of the Student Program, containing the core algorithmic logic for solving the problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d3eac5a8ba5cac7de40889ced9fb5315&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f089790696661ee6abceff90f9924d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c02916b7b0e5a87f92d544844a99ec6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8639879bd177c95139010b9025b24c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec34f58c7576beef3e1ee627c114a25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeffa4db6e2444dac981d2f6e46c8e68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a0e68ffe11c5d605b2d172bc117a660&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24e91156da41d8c127cfcd98fd99217c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47e1da39547e4d5d5cdafb2530c061c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46766da85f9f13835e435950173174a4</data>
