    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 2/2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">82.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 2/2 is a component of the Student Program, specifically handling the output of swap operations, and is likely the source of the error."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 is a component of the Student Program, specifically showing the output logic for swap operations, and is part of the flawed implementation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 is a core component of the Student Program, containing the main logic for computing minimal operations to form a 双生数组."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 是 Student Program 的组成部分，负责输出结果，是错误答案的直接来源。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 is a critical component of the Student Program, containing the flawed logic that leads to the partial correctness error."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 is a critical part of the Student Program containing the flawed logic that leads to incorrect results."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 is a critical part of the Student Program, containing the core flawed logic for median and count computation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 is a critical component of the Student Program, responsible for outputting swap operations, and its structure suggests a flaw in the logic of coordinate handling."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2是Student Program的关键组成部分，负责输出交换指令，其格式错误是导致答案错误的直接技术原因。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program includes Program Segment 2/2 as its implementation portion, which is incomplete or erroneous."</data>
