    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">309.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Error Description evaluates the Student Program’s performance, identifying it as partially correct with a low score, indicating flaws in logic or edge-case handling."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Error Description identifies flaws in the Student Program, specifically that it fails to correctly determine reachability, likely due to insufficient state bounds or sqrt precision issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is directly associated with the Error Description, as it is the source of the incorrect output that was identified and documented."&lt;SEP&gt;The Error Description is an authoritative evaluative document that directly identifies and analyzes the Student Program as incorrect due to fundamental logical and implementation flaws, resulting in its failure to produce a valid “好矩阵” (good matrix). The Student Program is the sole subject of the Error Description, and the relationship between the two is causal and diagnostic: the program’s defective code directly triggers the errors documented in the Error Description. Specifically, the Student Program contains critical logical errors, including the misuse of array values as indices, incorrect handling of the edge case where m=0, and an incomplete backward traversal, all of which invalidate its output. Additionally, its mathematical formulation for computing the expected absolute difference is flawed, leading to a consistent mismatch between its output and the required specification for a 好矩阵. These are not minor oversights but core defects that render the program’s solution ineffective, despite adherence to operation limits. The Error Description serves not only as a diagnostic tool but also as the official assessment mechanism, explicitly documenting these failures as the primary reason for the Student Program’s low score of 40.0. Multiple descriptions confirm that the Error Description provides a comprehensive, verified analysis of the program’s shortcomings, establishing a clear and consistent chain of causality between the Student Program’s flawed implementation and its erroneous output. Thus, the two entities form an inseparable pair in the evaluation framework—the Student Program is the source of failure, and the Error Description is the validated, analytical response that defines and explains its inadequacy.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is flagged by the Error Description for producing incorrect results, indicating a flaw in its logic or boundary handling."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is flagged in the Error Description as incorrect due to logical flaws in its BFS implementation, particularly in the termination condition and square root handling."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program received the Error Description as feedback, indicating it partially works but contains critical flaws leading to low score."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5df2edc3d03ec6c5e1b9a6d2ff7905f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0b936b6b647a37d956fdf66cd57a12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d2aa75d8324c591292a5206cbd69bde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-985dca88cf19334aa6bccf195ded5fbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fbb166f8ec0a1178f2d878ecaab5e98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47baadad1b80a9eb7ea15b9cd824968b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fa52e5b330629e1cee02304480f542&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2c34d00a1cb1d7916cefb78fbc43896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d7c8c700f1653b2de9c2e270fef6e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fe6cf8d6835af29afa5ade64370e360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca7b7c2c9549b0f15b3ed9c255cd57c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e118fc6033f61b8968a68a6cbe21cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeffa4db6e2444dac981d2f6e46c8e68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-412f096b4887f07bc254759a350f79a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180c6e0fe94889fc71026468d48a172f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a0e68ffe11c5d605b2d172bc117a660&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47e1da39547e4d5d5cdafb2530c061c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-264071873a8220efc52cdb3c6f973f1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8571d78ef0982dfe0d6ef86e585cbe98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46766da85f9f13835e435950173174a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4815d1a22ec8a935241a5f566cd9c42f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e091fd25a6ba2509fa168c85c52636ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bcd1771d7e55d80f714bbc3d88370bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb748d740807dc942d42a2dc4f25d05d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7230c75a37c25448800f6f28d89050f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c02916b7b0e5a87f92d544844a99ec6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-877df4ea12833328944aec827f97328b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d300103154c5f70514a4d86cc50a94df</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
