      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program attempts to output pairs of coordinates for adjacent swaps, implying it is designed to perform the allowed operation to reach the target matrix."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to implement the adjacent character swap operation by outputting coordinate pairs, suggesting it is meant to generate the sequence of swaps needed to reach the 好矩阵."</data>
