    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;好矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">82.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program attempts to achieve the '好矩阵' configuration by moving '1's to the top-left quadrant using adjacent swaps, but fails due to flawed logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program aims to transform an input matrix into a 好矩阵 by moving '1's to the top-left quadrant using adjacent swaps, making it an attempt to realize the 好矩阵 event."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is an attempted solution to produce the 好矩阵, but it is deemed incorrect according to the error description, indicating a failure to correctly generate the target configuration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program aims to transform the input matrix into a 好矩阵 using adjacent swaps, making the goal of the program directly tied to achieving the 好矩阵 condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program is intended to produce a sequence of swaps that transforms the input matrix into a '好矩阵', but fails to do so correctly according to the error description."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is designed to transform an arbitrary 01 matrix into a '好矩阵' by moving '1's to the top-left quadrant using adjacent swaps, making it an attempted implementation of the '好矩阵' event."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is an attempted computational solution to transform an input matrix into a '好矩阵', though it contains logical errors in the swapping algorithm."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 的目标是生成好矩阵，但其逻辑错误导致无法正确构造该目标状态，因此存在功能上的强关联但失败。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is designed to transform an arbitrary 01 matrix into a 好矩阵 by swapping adjacent elements, making it an implementation attempt toward achieving the 好矩阵 event."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program aims to transform an input matrix into a '好矩阵', but its flawed logic (e.g., incorrect counting with cnti/cntj and incomplete movement logic) prevents it from achieving the target state."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-66aa472cb9a249d5511f69ff4cdc9520&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2c34d00a1cb1d7916cefb78fbc43896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f089790696661ee6abceff90f9924d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c02916b7b0e5a87f92d544844a99ec6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeffa4db6e2444dac981d2f6e46c8e68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-412f096b4887f07bc254759a350f79a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a0e68ffe11c5d605b2d172bc117a660&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24e91156da41d8c127cfcd98fd99217c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47e1da39547e4d5d5cdafb2530c061c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46766da85f9f13835e435950173174a4</data>
