    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d3">54.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student program is the implementation of smallL's problem-solving approach, attempting to automate the transformation from n to m using the taught operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is the fictional user of the Student Program, which is designed to solve the problem he faces in transforming n to m."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is the hypothetical user of the Student Program, which is meant to solve the problem he was given by炸鸡, but the program contains bugs that prevent correct solutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is the user of the Student Program, which implements the solution to the problem he was assigned, indicating his attempt to automate the mathematical transformation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's program is an attempt by the student (representing small L's problem-solving effort) to implement the solution for transforming n to m using the taught operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L's problem is the direct subject of the Student Program, which is an attempted solution by a student to automate the transformation from n to m."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L's problem is being solved by the Student Program, which attempts to algorithmically determine if n can be transformed to m using the given operations."</data>
