      <data key="d3">40.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"x is the central variable defining the target value for the determinant construction problem, making it the key parameter the problem and program revolve around."&lt;SEP&gt;"x is the target value that the 3阶行列式 must equal, making it the core constraint of the 行列式构造问题."&lt;SEP&gt;"x is the core target variable in the determinant construction problem, defining the required value the determinant must equal."&lt;SEP&gt;"x is the target value that the constructed 3x3 determinant must equal, making it the central constraint of the problem event."</data>
