    <edge source="&quot;X&quot;" target="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d3">179.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"'X' is the symbol used by 小L to mark their moves on the tic-tac-toe board, directly representing their actions and ownership of cells."&lt;SEP&gt;X is the symbol used by 小L to mark their moves on the tic-tac-toe board, directly representing 小L’s actions and establishing a clear, consistent association between the player and their game piece. Every X placed on the 3x3 grid during gameplay is a deliberate move made by 小L as part of their strategy to form a winning line, and the symbol serves as a direct representation of 小L’s identity and ownership within the game. While the majority of descriptions consistently refer to X as the tic-tac-toe marker for 小L, one description introduces a conflicting context in which “x” is described as a cost variable that 小L must consider when deciding whether to flip bits in a or b — an operational decision in a computational or binary context. These two uses of “X” or “x” are semantically distinct: the uppercase “X” refers exclusively to the game symbol in tic-tac-toe, while the lowercase “x” denotes a cost parameter in a separate algorithmic or bitwise operation. Therefore, the two contexts do not contradict but rather describe different domains — one recreational (tic-tac-toe) and one computational (bit manipulation). In summary, 小L uses the symbol “X” to mark their moves in tic-tac-toe, and independently, 小L considers a cost variable “x” in bitwise operations, with no overlap between the two uses beyond the shared letter.&lt;SEP&gt;"X is the symbol used by 小L to mark their moves on the tic-tac-toe board, directly representing 小L's actions in the game."&lt;SEP&gt;"'X' is the symbol used to represent 小L's moves on the board, directly associating the mark with the player's actions."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea15e123e23c10fb0dd1d2aa46c0de25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41bb705f581ef523c90424ea77cfe827&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a376d30d059b09f44ce6681d11e112d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0414d324dc902fa7bfe392b580d12b0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b256fd1c0676b66deece8e4e49ff37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8674c89c2bbd80ac2ed7bf4f4ece7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a625df4ed1e048ecc8681beebcec0a9e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
