    <edge source="&quot;X&quot;" target="&quot;TIC-TAC-TOE GAME&quot;">
      <data key="d3">54.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 'X' symbol is one of the two game markers used in the tic-tac-toe game to indicate a player's move."&lt;SEP&gt;"X is a core game state symbol in the tic-tac-toe game, representing 小L's attempts to form a winning line."&lt;SEP&gt;"X is one of the two player symbols used in the tic-tac-toe game, essential for determining win conditions and game progression."&lt;SEP&gt;"X is one of the two symbols defining the state of the tic-tac-toe game, used to track 小L's progress toward winning."&lt;SEP&gt;"X symbols on the board are key components of the tic-tac-toe game state, contributing to potential winning lines for 小L."&lt;SEP&gt;"X is one of the two state symbols defining the current configuration of the tic-tac-toe game, essential for evaluating winning conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"X marks are integral to the state of the tic-tac-toe game, as they represent 小L's attempts to form a winning line."</data>
