      <data key="d3">32.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"'X' occupies a cell in the 3x3 grid, contributing to the board state and potential win paths for 小L."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'X' marks are placed within the 3x3 grid cells to represent 小L's moves in the game."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 grid is the spatial structure where 'X' markers are placed by 小L during gameplay."&lt;SEP&gt;"The symbol 'X' is placed within cells of the 3x3 grid to represent 小L's moves, making it an integral part of the game's spatial structure."</data>
