      <data key="d3">12.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"China is the cultural and educational context where the 3阶行列式构造问题 is presented, likely in a Chinese academic setting."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is the cultural and educational context where this mathematical problem is posed, likely in a Chinese academic setting."</data>
