      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"e is the critical variable element in the 3阶行列式构造问题, designed to tune the determinant to x, but its flawed computation causes the solution to fail."&lt;SEP&gt;"e is the dynamically computed element critical to achieving the determinant value x; its incorrect calculation in the student program leads to the solution’s failure."</data>
