    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;BFS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">29.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"A provides the binary grid data that BFS traverses to identify connected components and boundary cells."&lt;SEP&gt;"The grid array 'a' contains the binary values that BFS traverses to identify connected components."&lt;SEP&gt;"The grid array 'a' contains the data that BFS traverses, distinguishing between 1s (traversable) and 0s (boundaries)."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c43422d516179991d5c796063c71f443</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;GRID TRAVERSAL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The grid traversal algorithm processes the grid stored in array 'a' to identify connected regions."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;B&quot;">
      <data key="d3">50.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a 和 b 必须完全相等，且分别代表连续子串和不连续子序列，是定义可爱度 k 的核心条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a 和 b 是‘可爱度’定义中必须相等的两个结构：a 是连续子串，b 是不连续子序列，二者长度均为 k。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a和b是进行异或运算的两个操作数，它们的每一位组合决定是否需要操作以匹配c，二者在逻辑上紧密耦合。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a和b是参与异或运算的两个二进制数，所有操作均旨在调整它们以满足a⊕b=c的条件，二者直接相互影响。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a和b是位运算中参与异或运算的两个操作数，它们的状态共同决定是否满足a⊕b=c。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f71a436c68bda6c051ade04f84d6c77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"t 是目标字符串，必须包含至少一个长度为 m 的连续子串 a，以满足可爱度要求。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4f71a436c68bda6c051ade04f84d6c77</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;(CHAR)('A' + I - 1)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"该字符构造语句用于生成连续子串 a 的内容，但其顺序和长度控制错误，导致 a 可能不满足长度 m 的要求。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4f71a436c68bda6c051ade04f84d6c77</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;SUM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">34.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Sum accumulates values from array 'a' during iteration; if 'a' is uninitialized or improperly indexed, it causes runtime errors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sum is computed by iterating over elements of matrix a[u][v] along a diagonal, making a the source data for Sum's calculation."&lt;SEP&gt;"sum is computed from diagonal elements of matrix a and used to adjust tmp values during normal diagonal traversal."&lt;SEP&gt;"sum[1][i] is assigned the value of Sum, which is computed from array 'a'; mismatched dimensions or uninitialized 'a' may cause crashes."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d887a2fa6fff76122dbcba92f32c0d9f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a is the source data array from which diagonal sums are computed and stored in sum2, making it the foundational input to the sum2 structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"sum2 is derived from diagonal sums of matrix a, used to handle edge cases when indices exceed matrix bounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"sum2[0][i] and sum2[1][i] are computed using values from 'a' with complex index logic; potential out-of-bounds access or uninitialized 'a' leads to runtime error."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d887a2fa6fff76122dbcba92f32c0d9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m defines the column bounds for array 'a'; if m is invalid, loops over 'm' may access memory outside array bounds."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;U&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"u is used as a row index to access array 'a'; if u becomes negative or exceeds array bounds, it causes runtime errors."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;V&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"v is used as a column index to access array 'a'; unbounded increments or decrements may lead to invalid memory access."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;C&quot;">
      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a与c通过异或运算关联，目标是使a⊕b的结果等于c，因此a的每一位变化直接影响c的可达性。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a需要通过操作调整，使其与b异或的结果等于c，c是a的最终目标输出状态，二者通过异或关系直接关联。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a需通过操作调整，使得与b异或后的结果等于c，c是a的运算目标，二者通过异或关系绑定。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;Y&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"y决定了交换a中任意两位的代价，是优化a结构（位序）的核心成本参数。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d3">33.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小L manipulates the binary number 'a' through operations to meet the target condition a⊕b=c."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L直接操作二进制数a，通过翻转或交换位来改变其值以满足a⊕b=c的条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小L拥有并操作二进制数a，是其控制和修改的主体。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小L拥有并操作二进制数a，是a的控制者和修改者。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;A⊕B=C&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The binary number 'a' is a direct operand in the equation a⊕b=c, and its bits are modified via operations to satisfy the condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"a是构成目标事件a⊕b=c的两个操作数之一，其值的变化直接影响异或结果是否等于c。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;翻转操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">25.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a是翻转操作的直接作用对象，其每一位可被反置以改变异或结果。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a的每一位可被翻转操作修改，翻转是改变a值的直接手段之一，用于逼近目标c。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a是翻转操作的直接作用对象，其每一位可被独立翻转以改变其值。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;交换操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">31.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a是交换操作的直接作用对象，其任意两位可被交换以重组位模式。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a是交换操作的直接作用对象，其数位可被重新排列以优化异或结果。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a的位顺序可通过交换操作重排，从而改变其与b异或后的结果，是优化成本的重要策略。"&lt;SEP&gt;"交换操作可重新排列a的位顺序，从而间接改变a⊕b的结果，是达成目标的非局部调整方式。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;按位异或运算&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a是按位异或运算的左操作数，其值直接影响c的计算结果。"&lt;SEP&gt;"按位异或运算是定义在a和b上的核心数学操作，其结果必须等于c，是整个问题的约束条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;N位二进制数&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a是n位二进制数的具体实例，具有相同的位数约束。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;反置操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"反置操作可直接修改a的任意一位，是调整a以满足a⊕b=c的直接手段。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;F&quot;">
      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The matrix 'a' is evaluated to determine the state of flag 'f', which depends on whether any element in a row or column exceeds 1."&lt;SEP&gt;"The matrix 'a' is scanned to determine the value of flag 'f', which depends on whether any element in a row or column exceeds 1."&lt;SEP&gt;"The variable f is derived from checking values in array a to determine if any element exceeds 1, establishing a direct dependency."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c79d0a874a6ba47efd4742ec70c1e196&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13a9ab5634b62de5516cbb77c8616b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffffe6b4389bb3df97140e17e088aa9b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">25.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Index 'i' is used to access rows in matrix 'a' during evaluation of row-wise conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The variable i is used as a row index to access elements in array a, establishing a structural relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"Variable 'i' is used as a row index to access elements in matrix 'a', forming the basis for row-specific logic checks."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c79d0a874a6ba47efd4742ec70c1e196&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13a9ab5634b62de5516cbb77c8616b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffffe6b4389bb3df97140e17e088aa9b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;J&quot;">
      <data key="d3">25.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Index 'j' is used to access columns in matrix 'a' during evaluation of column-wise conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The variable j is used as a column index to access elements in array a, establishing a structural relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"Variable 'j' is used as a column index to access elements in matrix 'a', forming the basis for column-specific logic checks."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c79d0a874a6ba47efd4742ec70c1e196&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13a9ab5634b62de5516cbb77c8616b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffffe6b4389bb3df97140e17e088aa9b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;FLAG&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The state of 'flag' is determined based on the values in matrix 'a', particularly when no elements exceed 1, indicating a valid configuration."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ffffe6b4389bb3df97140e17e088aa9b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;B&quot;" target="&quot;T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"t 是目标字符串，必须包含一个长度为 m 的不连续子序列 b，且 b = a，才能满足可爱度定义。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4f71a436c68bda6c051ade04f84d6c77</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;B&quot;" target="&quot;(CHAR)('A' + N - I)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"该递减字符构造用于生成字符串尾部，意图构造不连续子序列 b 的部分字符，但因位置错乱，无法形成不相邻子串结构。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4f71a436c68bda6c051ade04f84d6c77</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;B&quot;" target="&quot;C&quot;">
      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"b与c通过异或运算关联，b的每一位变化直接影响a⊕b是否等于c，是达成目标的关键变量。"&lt;SEP&gt;"b需要通过操作调整，使其与a异或的结果等于c，c是b的最终目标输出状态，二者通过异或关系直接关联。"&lt;SEP&gt;"b需通过操作调整，使得与a异或后的结果等于c，c是b的运算目标，二者通过异或关系绑定。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;B&quot;" target="&quot;Y&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"y决定了交换b中任意两位的代价，是优化b结构（位序）的核心成本参数。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;B&quot;" target="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d3">33.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小L manipulates the binary number 'b' through operations to meet the target condition a⊕b=c."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L直接操作二进制数b，通过翻转或交换位来改变其值以满足a⊕b=c的条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小L拥有并操作二进制数b，是其控制和修改的主体。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小L拥有并操作二进制数b，是b的控制者和修改者。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;B&quot;" target="&quot;A⊕B=C&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The binary number 'b' is a direct operand in the equation a⊕b=c, and its bits are modified via operations to satisfy the condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"b是构成目标事件a⊕b=c的两个操作数之一，其值的变化直接影响异或结果是否等于c。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;B&quot;" target="&quot;翻转操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">25.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"b是翻转操作的直接作用对象，其每一位可被反置以改变异或结果。"&lt;SEP&gt;"b的每一位可被翻转操作修改，翻转是改变b值的直接手段之一，用于逼近目标c。"&lt;SEP&gt;"b是翻转操作的直接作用对象，其每一位可被独立翻转以改变其值。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;B&quot;" target="&quot;交换操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">31.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"b是交换操作的直接作用对象，其任意两位可被交换以重组位模式。"&lt;SEP&gt;"b是交换操作的直接作用对象，其数位可被重新排列以优化异或结果。"&lt;SEP&gt;"b的位顺序可通过交换操作重排，从而改变其与a异或后的结果，是优化成本的重要策略。"&lt;SEP&gt;"交换操作可重新排列b的位顺序，从而间接改变a⊕b的结果，是达成目标的非局部调整方式。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;B&quot;" target="&quot;按位异或运算&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"b是按位异或运算的右操作数，其值直接影响c的计算结果。"&lt;SEP&gt;"按位异或运算是定义在a和b上的核心数学操作，其结果必须等于c，是整个问题的约束条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;B&quot;" target="&quot;N位二进制数&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"b是n位二进制数的具体实例，具有相同的位数约束。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;B&quot;" target="&quot;反置操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"反置操作可直接修改b的任意一位，是调整b以满足a⊕b=c的直接手段。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;C&quot;" target="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d3">37.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小L aims to make the result of a⊕b equal to the given binary number 'c'."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L的操作目标是使a⊕b的结果等于c，c是小L操作的最终目标状态。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小L的目标是使a⊕b的结果等于c，c是其操作的最终目标。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小L的目标是使a⊕b等于c，c是其操作的参考标准。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;C&quot;" target="&quot;A⊕B=C&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The binary number 'c' is the target result of the XOR operation between a and b, defining the goal of the event."&lt;SEP&gt;"c是目标事件a⊕b=c的预期结果，所有操作的最终目的就是使a⊕b的值等于c。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;C&quot;" target="&quot;按位异或运算&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"c是按位异或运算的目标结果，问题要求通过操作使a⊕b的结果等于c。"&lt;SEP&gt;"按位异或运算的结果必须精确等于c，c是该运算的目标输出，构成问题的判定标准。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
