    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">143.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Error Description directly critiques the flaws in Program Segment 1/2, identifying its incorrect behavior and deviation from the expected solution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Error Description指出学生程序的错误，直接对应Program Segment 1/2中cnti/cntj更新逻辑缺陷和交换顺序错误。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is the code that the Error Description evaluates as incorrect, directly linking the flawed implementation to its diagnostic feedback."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 的实现逻辑导致了 Error Description 中指出的答案错误，二者存在直接因果关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Program Segment 1/2 is the submitted code that received the Error Description as its evaluation result, directly linking the implementation to its scoring feedback."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Program Segment 1/2 contains bugs that directly cause the errors described in the Error Description, such as flawed median selection and incorrect pairing logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Program Segment 1/2 is directly responsible for the error described, as its logic fails to fully solve the problem, resulting in a 40.0 score."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Program Segment 1/2 submission directly triggered the Error Description, as its flawed logic resulted in only 40.0 points scored."&lt;SEP&gt;"The logic in Program Segment 1/2 is flagged by the Error Description as incorrect, establishing a causal relationship between the flawed code and its diagnostic evaluation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Error Description directly references the failure of the logic implemented in Program Segment 1/2, identifying it as the source of incorrect output."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Error Description directly references the incorrect behavior of the logic in Program Segment 1/2, identifying it as the source of the failure."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 的实现被Error Description判定为错误，因其无法正确生成好矩阵或超出操作限制。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The student’s Program Segment 1/2 is directly evaluated and flagged by the Error Description as incorrect due to flawed logic in moving '1's to the top-left quadrant."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 的错误行为直接导致了 Error Description 中指出的‘答案不正确’结论。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is the source of the Error Description, as its flawed logic directly causes the mismatch between expected and actual output in the evaluation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-66aa472cb9a249d5511f69ff4cdc9520&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3eac5a8ba5cac7de40889ced9fb5315&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f089790696661ee6abceff90f9924d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2a57305752e3a687103dd58dbee53bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bbc06444b81cde07bd3f70e96886225&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f83dfef3345c73ed407093c9749130b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8639879bd177c95139010b9025b24c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8796025571904280b91872c5eb3f6610&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec34f58c7576beef3e1ee627c114a25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad8afc7ac300d86b72e962805041fa5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0be1ff21d6f00384f294e712dc03c7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d45a376c5f8e29b656fb8024a9e1fab6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24e91156da41d8c127cfcd98fd99217c</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
