    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;双生数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Program Segment 1/2 attempts to transform an input array into a 双生数组 by applying median-based pairing, but fails due to incorrect implementation of the required conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The concept of '双生数组' is the target state that the Program Segment 1/2 tries to achieve through sorting and median manipulation, but the implementation is incomplete or incorrect."&lt;SEP&gt;"The concept of 双生数组 is the target state that the Program Segment 1/2 attempts to achieve, but fails to correctly compute due to incorrect median and partition logic."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d45a376c5f8e29b656fb8024a9e1fab6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad8afc7ac300d86b72e962805041fa5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0be1ff21d6f00384f294e712dc03c7a</data>
