      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 uses adjacent character swaps as its core mechanism to reposition elements, but the sequence of swaps is logically flawed and inefficient."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2使用相邻字符交换操作来移动矩阵中的'1'，但其交换序列设计错误，导致无法稳定定位到左上区域。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5a0e68ffe11c5d605b2d172bc117a660&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f83dfef3345c73ed407093c9749130b5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
