    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;好矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 aims to construct a 好矩阵 by moving '1's to the top-left quadrant, but its swap logic fails to correctly position all '1's as required by the definition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 的目标是生成一个符合好矩阵定义的输出，其逻辑试图将输入矩阵转换为左上角全为'1'的结构。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is an attempted computational solution to construct a '好矩阵' by swapping adjacent elements, but it does not correctly achieve the required quadrant configuration."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bbc06444b81cde07bd3f70e96886225&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec34f58c7576beef3e1ee627c114a25</data>
