    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 2/2&quot;" target="&quot;好矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 2/2 is intended to generate operations that transform the input matrix into a 好矩阵, but its output format or logic fails to achieve the required configuration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 is intended to generate output that would transform a matrix into a 好矩阵, but fails to do so correctly, indicating a mismatch between the target event and the program's logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵 is the target state that Program Segment 2/2 is intended to achieve through adjacent swaps, but the segment fails to correctly generate the required transformation sequence."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1fe6cf8d6835af29afa5ade64370e360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d7c8c700f1653b2de9c2e270fef6e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d300103154c5f70514a4d86cc50a94df</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
