    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;1~N&quot;" target="&quot;[L_I,R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"[l_i,r_i] 的取值必须在 1~n 范围内，否则无法构成合法排列，二者共同构成问题的数值约束体系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"[l_i,r_i] 的取值必须是 1~n 的子集，每个约束区间都受限于该全局数值域。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e99c195bf139756748ff95a63861cbef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab26ec20fcd79dc385eb33e508c23dea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;1~N&quot;" target="&quot;井然有序之窗&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"井然有序之窗”要求排列元素必须来自 1~n 且不重复，是其“有序”定义的数学基础。"&lt;SEP&gt;"井然有序之窗问题的核心是构造一个使用1~n整数的排列，1~n是问题定义的合法数值范围。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e99c195bf139756748ff95a63861cbef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab26ec20fcd79dc385eb33e508c23dea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;井然有序之窗&quot;" target="&quot;[L_I,R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"井然有序之窗”问题的本质是满足每个位置的区间约束 [l_i,r_i]，是其命名所象征的“有序”实现条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"井然有序之窗问题要求每个位置 i 的元素必须落在 [l_i,r_i] 范围内，这是问题的唯一约束条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e99c195bf139756748ff95a63861cbef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab26ec20fcd79dc385eb33e508c23dea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;井然有序之窗&quot;" target="&quot;排列&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"井然有序之窗是该排列构造问题的隐喻性标题，象征在约束中达成有序排列的挑战。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;[L_I,R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;贪心算法&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"贪心算法试图满足每个 [l_i,r_i] 约束，但因未按右端点优先排序，无法保证所有约束可被满足。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e99c195bf139756748ff95a63861cbef</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;T&quot;" target="&quot;M = 3E5 +7&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"T is declared as an array of size M, which is set to 3e5+7 to safely hold all possible constraints for n up to 300,000, showing alignment with memory planning in Chinese programming contests."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1b590abbdea60c545ca54c73ea12cc6b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;T&quot;" target="&quot;M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"t 的可爱度必须恰好等于 m，m 是 t 必须满足的核心输出要求。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;T&quot;" target="&quot;连续子串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"连续子串是字符串 t 中必须存在的一个子结构，其最大长度定义了 t 的可爱度。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;T&quot;" target="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"不连续子序列是字符串 t 中必须存在的另一个子结构，其长度需与某连续子串相等，共同决定 t 的可爱度。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;BFS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">25.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The BFS algorithm operates on a grid of size n x m, where m defines the number of columns."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BFS algorithm uses the variable m to determine the horizontal bounds of the grid during traversal."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BFS algorithm uses M as a boundary constraint to validate grid coordinates during traversal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c43422d516179991d5c796063c71f443</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;GRID TRAVERSAL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Grid traversal operates within the bounds defined by m (columns) and n (rows)."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;字符串外串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">64.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m 作为可爱度目标，是‘字符串外串’事件中要求匹配的核心数值指标，决定是否存在合法字符串。"&lt;SEP&gt;"m 作为输入参数，是‘字符串外串’事件中目标可爱度的数值要求。"&lt;SEP&gt;"m 是‘字符串外串’事件中必须满足的输出目标，用于判断是否存在符合条件的字符串。"&lt;SEP&gt;"m 是‘字符串外串’事件中的核心目标参数，定义了要求的可爱度值。"&lt;SEP&gt;"m 是‘字符串外串’问题的输入参数，代表目标可爱度，是判断解存在的关键条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"m 是‘字符串外串’问题的目标输出参数，要求构造的字符串必须恰好具有该可爱度。"&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串题目以 m 作为目标可爱度，是判断字符串存在性的核心约束."&lt;SEP&gt;"m 是‘字符串外串’问题的目标输出值，要求构造字符串使其可爱度恰好等于 m。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-67a35ea6ed4e42eb7c4874b218ee041d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-435d0b64fef9c51a64d020305df4c4a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f71a436c68bda6c051ade04f84d6c77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca7b7c2c9549b0f15b3ed9c255cd57c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd5a87d368619780b9c83a36a26e8d95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8571d78ef0982dfe0d6ef86e585cbe98</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;CNT = 2 * M - N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m 是计算 cnt 的关键输入变量，cnt = 2*m - n 依赖 m 的值决定重复字符的规模。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;牛可乐&quot;">
      <data key="d3">55.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"牛可乐 defines the problem where m is the target可爱度 that the string t must achieve."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 defines the target可爱度 m that the constructed string must exactly achieve."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐在问题中设定m作为目标可爱度，是判断字符串是否符合条件的核心指标。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐在题目中定义了参数 m 作为目标可爱度，是学生程序必须满足的输出条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐在问题中设定了 m 作为可爱度的目标值，是其定义的核心度量标准。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐在题目中定义了参数 m 作为目标可爱度，是学生程序必须满足的输出约束。"&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐定义了 m 作为目标可爱度，是判断字符串是否符合条件的关键输出标准。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-67a35ea6ed4e42eb7c4874b218ee041d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79af8c07e093eeaf2a8b54738698e7af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cb4bd7875d45de235db605ada816662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca7b7c2c9549b0f15b3ed9c255cd57c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8571d78ef0982dfe0d6ef86e585cbe98</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;可爱度&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m是可爱度的具体数值目标，直接决定字符串是否合法，是问题输出判断的唯一依据。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8cb4bd7875d45de235db605ada816662</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;STD::CIN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"std::cin 用于读取输入参数 m，是程序获取目标可爱度的直接途径。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-435d0b64fef9c51a64d020305df4c4a9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;STD::CIN &gt;&gt; N &gt;&gt; M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"std::cin &gt;&gt; n &gt;&gt; m事件直接读取m的值，是m参数在程序中的来源。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-cd5a87d368619780b9c83a36a26e8d95</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;FOR(INT I = 1; I &lt;= N - M; ++ I) S[I] = (CHAR)('A' + I - 1)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"该循环的迭代次数依赖n - m，m直接影响前缀长度，是构造差异化的关键参数。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-cd5a87d368619780b9c83a36a26e8d95</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;FOR(INT I = N; I &gt; M; -- I) S[I] = (CHAR)('A' + N - I)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"该循环终止于m，m决定了后缀的结束点，是构造目标子串长度的关键。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-cd5a87d368619780b9c83a36a26e8d95</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;字符串 T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"字符串 t must have 可爱度 exactly equal to m, as required by the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串 t must have可爱度 exactly equal to m, as required by the problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-79af8c07e093eeaf2a8b54738698e7af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31863a3502540c31035499a1b63c97c2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">35.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Grid Map has m columns, defining its horizontal dimension and constraining valid column indices for Dragon's Breath."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map has m columns, defining its horizontal size and constraining where Dragon's Breath can propagate."&lt;SEP&gt;"m defines the number of columns in the Grid Map, establishing its horizontal size and boundaries for Dragon's Breath propagation."&lt;SEP&gt;"m defines the number of columns in the Grid Map, establishing its horizontal dimension."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;J&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m bounds the iteration of j, defining the horizontal extent of the matrix traversal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d887a2fa6fff76122dbcba92f32c0d9f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"i is bounded by m, meaning m governs the number of diagonals processed in the outer loop, directly linking the loop range to the array's width."&lt;SEP&gt;"i iterates up to m; if m is zero or negative, loops over sum2[1][i] and sum2[0][i] may be skipped or access invalid memory."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;A[U][V]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m defines the column dimension of the 2D array a[u][v], constraining the range of valid indices for v."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小L的目标是将n变为m，m是其运算的期望输出结果。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小L的目标是将数字n变为m，m是其操作的最终目标状态。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小L的目标是将数字n通过运算变为m，m是其期望达到的输出状态。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c22dbdf1f3163e7e66ae88a5409cc589&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5df2edc3d03ec6c5e1b9a6d2ff7905f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180c6e0fe94889fc71026468d48a172f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;平方和开方运算&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m是平方和开方运算希望达成的目标状态，运算规则的设计围绕能否从n到达m展开。"&lt;SEP&gt;"m是平方和开方运算的目标结果，运算的目的是验证是否能从n到达m。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c22dbdf1f3163e7e66ae88a5409cc589&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180c6e0fe94889fc71026468d48a172f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;SOLVE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The solve function must handle m independent queries, so m determines the number of times the function is invoked or processed."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;PERMUTATION P&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"permutation p is subject to m independent queries, each testing a different subinterval and target position."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS[M]&quot;" target="&quot;L = 1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"l = 1 的值被依次赋给 ans[M] 中的对应位置，是结果数组填充的直接来源。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ab26ec20fcd79dc385eb33e508c23dea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS[M]&quot;" target="&quot;输出 -1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"当 ans[M] 未能完全填充（l &lt;= n）时，程序输出 -1，二者构成输出逻辑的判断分支。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ab26ec20fcd79dc385eb33e508c23dea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STD::SORT&quot;" target="&quot;L = 1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"std::sort 确保了区间按左边界有序，使 l = 1 的贪心策略能够按序尝试分配，是策略可行的前提。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ab26ec20fcd79dc385eb33e508c23dea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;构造排列问题&quot;" target="&quot;1 \SIM N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The construction problem fundamentally requires using all integers from 1 to n exactly once, making this range essential to the event’s definition."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f6dde8d5dace842a3db295bc3a2b69c2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;构造排列问题&quot;" target="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The interval constraints [l_i, r_i] are the defining restrictions of the construction problem, determining feasibility and solution structure."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f6dde8d5dace842a3db295bc3a2b69c2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;构造排列问题&quot;" target="&quot;\{2,3,1,5,4\}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"\{2,3,1,5,4\} serves as a correct example of the output expected from the construction permutation problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f6dde8d5dace842a3db295bc3a2b69c2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;构造排列问题&quot;" target="&quot;\{1,2,2\}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"\{1,2,2\} illustrates an invalid case that the construction permutation problem explicitly rejects due to duplication."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f6dde8d5dace842a3db295bc3a2b69c2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;构造排列问题&quot;" target="&quot;\{1,3,4\}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"\{1,3,4\} illustrates an invalid case that the construction permutation problem rejects due to missing or out-of-range values."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f6dde8d5dace842a3db295bc3a2b69c2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;1 ~ N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"1 ~ n 是全局可用数字集合，[l_i, r_i] 是每个位置的子集约束，二者共同定义合法排列的搜索空间。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Each [l_i, r_i] constraint must be a subset of the 1 ~ n domain; otherwise, no valid permutation exists, making this relationship fundamental to the problem’s feasibility."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1b590abbdea60c545ca54c73ea12cc6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-512301a13a22c9eae82f981e0542065a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;排列&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"每个位置的 [l_i, r_i] 区间直接约束排列中对应元素的取值，是排列合法性的核心条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;第 I 个元素&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"第 i 个元素的取值必须落在 [l_i, r_i] 区间内，二者是直接的约束-被约束关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;VAL(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The intervals [l_i, r_i] define the random distribution of each a_i, which determines the statistical properties and expected value of val(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The value of val(a) depends entirely on the random generation of sequence elements within the intervals [l_i, r_i], establishing a foundational probabilistic relationship."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;SOLVE(A, B)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"solve(a, b) is designed to compute expectations over ranges, and is applied to [l_i, r_i] intervals via query() to model the random generation of each a_i."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;L[M]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"L[M] is the data structure implementation of the interval lower bounds [l_i, r_i] used in the problem definition."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;R[M]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"R[M] is the data structure implementation of the interval upper bounds [l_i, r_i] used in the problem definition."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SIGNED MAIN&quot;" target="&quot;SOLVE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"signed main调用solve函数处理每个测试用例，二者构成程序的主从控制关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d58149e2705f5337a0bc1e192ab33a56</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SIGNED MAIN&quot;" target="&quot;MIN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The signed main function uses Min as an input variable in its calculation logic, indicating a dependency."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4655c44a0c410e0c718d92b308d741b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SIGNED MAIN&quot;" target="&quot;Y&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The signed main function incorporates y as a parameter in its computation, showing direct usage."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4655c44a0c410e0c718d92b308d741b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;1 \SIM N&quot;" target="&quot;排列&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"排列必须恰好包含 1 到 n 的所有整数各一次，1 \sim n 是排列的值域基础。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;排列&quot;" target="&quot;重复元素&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"重复元素的存在会使数组非法，因此排列必须完全避免重复元素。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;排列&quot;" target="&quot;超出范围的数&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"若排列中任一元素超出其对应 [l_i, r_i]，则排列违反约束条件，为无效解。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;排列&quot;" target="&quot;子区间&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"子区间 is a contiguous segment extracted from a 排列 for sorting, making it a structural component of the permutation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;排列构造问题&quot;" target="&quot;算法竞赛&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"排列构造问题是一种典型算法竞赛题型，常出现在编程比赛的动态规划或贪心专题中。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-512301a13a22c9eae82f981e0542065a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;排列构造问题&quot;" target="&quot;贪心策略&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"贪心策略是解决排列构造问题的一种常见方法，但学生实现中存在缺陷，导致无法通过所有测试用例。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-512301a13a22c9eae82f981e0542065a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;算法竞赛&quot;" target="&quot;操作次数限制&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"操作次数限制是算法竞赛中常见的效率约束，用于筛选出最优或接近最优的解法，本题中n³/2即为此类约束的体现。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-06373e967b229fd23b64bfbbc0860861</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小苯&quot;" target="&quot;硝基甲苯之袭&quot;">
      <data key="d3">35.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小苯是‘硝基甲苯之袭’这一事件中的核心参与者，负责解决该算法问题，事件围绕他的计算任务展开。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯是‘硝基甲苯之袭’这一算法事件的直接参与者，负责解决其中的数学问题。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯是‘硝基甲苯之袭’这一题目事件中的主角，负责解决该问题。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯是‘硝基甲苯之袭’这一算法问题中的主角，负责解决该问题中的数学计算任务。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小苯&quot;" target="&quot;A_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">25.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小苯 is the problem solver who must determine valid pairs involving a_i as one element in the condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 is the problem solver who operates on the array elements a_i to find valid pairs satisfying the condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 is the problem solver who must evaluate all possible a_i values in the array to find valid pairs satisfying the XOR-GCD condition."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小苯&quot;" target="&quot;A_J&quot;">
      <data key="d3">25.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小苯 is evaluating pairs of elements including a_j, with j &gt; i, to count valid combinations."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 is the problem solver who must determine valid pairs involving a_j as the second element in the condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 must consider every a_j (with j &gt; i) to test the condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小苯&quot;" target="&quot;OI-WIKI&quot;">
      <data key="d3">5.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小苯在理解异或运算时可能参考了OI-Wiki的资源，该组织提供题目所需的知识支持。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;OI-WIKI&quot;" target="&quot;硝基甲苯之袭&quot;">
      <data key="d3">21.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"OI-Wiki 被引用为理解题目中异或运算的权威参考资料，支撑了该事件的数学基础。"&lt;SEP&gt;"‘硝基甲苯之袭’事件中引用了 OI-Wiki 作为位运算知识的权威参考来源，用于辅助理解异或运算。"&lt;SEP&gt;"‘硝基甲苯之袭’问题中提及的异或运算知识，其解释和参考资料来源于OI-Wiki平台，表明该事件依赖该组织提供的技术文档。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
