      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"硝基甲苯之袭 is the metaphorical title of the problem, symbolizing the unpredictable and potentially dangerous nature of the XOR-GCD relationship, as if the values 'attack' with unexpected bitwise behavior."</data>
