    <edge source="&quot;(I,J)&quot;" target="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze selects any coordinate (i,j) on the grid to unleash Dragon's Breath, making (i,j) the direct target of her action."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze targets cells (i,j) on the grid map to deploy Dragon's Breath, making (i,j) the input space for her ability."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2</data>
