    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;(I,J)&quot;" target="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">29.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"(i,j) is the coordinate system used to index and reference every cell in the Grid Map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each cell (i,j) is a discrete location within the Grid Map, where monster counts a_{i,j} are stored and accessed during Dragon's Breath calculation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map is composed of discrete cells identified by coordinates (i,j), forming its fundamental structure."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;(I,J)&quot;" target="&quot;S_{I,J}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"(i,j) is the coordinate index that defines the location for which s_{i,j} records the game state ('X', 'O', or 'G')."&lt;SEP&gt;"(i,j) is the coordinate that indexes the state variable s_{i,j}, defining the exact position and content of each cell on the board."&lt;SEP&gt;"s_{i,j} is the state variable defined for each coordinate (i,j), mapping the board's content to its spatial location."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8674c89c2bbd80ac2ed7bf4f4ece7a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
