    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;VIS[][]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"vis[][] 数组用于记录 bfs 遍历过程中访问过的砖块，防止循环和重复，保障算法正确执行。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-18e8858aadef99b81cf3431326cb24cb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;GRID TRAVERSAL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS is the algorithmic method used to perform grid traversal in the code, identifying connected components and counting adjacent boundary cells."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;DX&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The dx array defines horizontal movement directions used by BFS to explore adjacent cells in the grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dx array provides horizontal movement directions for the BFS algorithm to explore neighboring cells."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;DY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The dy array defines vertical movement directions used by BFS to explore adjacent cells in the grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dy array provides vertical movement directions for the BFS algorithm to explore neighboring cells."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;VIS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">29.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The vis array is used by BFS to mark visited cells and avoid cycles or redundant processing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The vis array is used by BFS to mark visited cells and avoid reprocessing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vis is used within BFS to mark visited cells and prevent reprocessing during traversal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c43422d516179991d5c796063c71f443</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;CNT1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS increments cnt1 for each visited cell with value 1 to count the size of the current connected component."&lt;SEP&gt;"BFS uses cnt1 to count the number of 1-cells in the current connected component."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;CNT2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS increments cnt2 whenever it encounters a neighboring cell with value 0, counting boundary cells around the component."&lt;SEP&gt;"BFS uses cnt2 to count the number of adjacent 0-cells surrounding the current component."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;ANS1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS updates ans1 to track the largest component size encountered during traversal."&lt;SEP&gt;"BFS updates ans1 when a larger connected component is found, tracking the maximum component size."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;MIN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS updates Min to store the minimum boundary count among all maximum-sized connected components."&lt;SEP&gt;"BFS updates Min to store the minimum surrounding 0-cells among the largest components."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
