      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SOLVE&quot;" target="&quot;MOD&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"solve uses mod to ensure all arithmetic operations remain within modular bounds, making mod essential to solve's correctness."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SOLVE&quot;" target="&quot;QUERY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The query function calls the solve function multiple times to compute expected absolute differences via inclusion-exclusion, establishing a direct functional dependency."&lt;SEP&gt;"The query function relies on the solve function to compute its results via inclusion-exclusion, making solve a foundational subroutine of query."&lt;SEP&gt;"query depends on solve to compute partial expected values over intervals, making solve a foundational component of query."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f207867e95527d1c21eb90640d585ef3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SOLVE&quot;" target="&quot;小鸡&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小鸡 designed the problem that requires the solve function to correctly compute the new position of elements after sorting subintervals, making solve central to the problem’s solution."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SOLVE&quot;" target="&quot;L_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The solve function uses l_i to define the start of each subinterval to be sorted during query processing."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SOLVE&quot;" target="&quot;R_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The solve function uses r_i to define the end of each subinterval to be sorted during query processing."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SOLVE&quot;" target="&quot;C_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The solve function must track and return the new position of the element originally at c_i after sorting the subinterval [l_i, r_i]."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;F&quot;" target="&quot;FLAG&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The value of 'f' is used to determine whether 'flag' is set to 1, indicating that all conditions for a valid matrix configuration have been met."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-13a9ab5634b62de5516cbb77c8616b93</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STD::COUT &lt;&lt; MIN &lt;&lt; '\\N';&quot;" target="&quot;SOLVE()&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"该输出语句依赖 solve() 函数的正确执行来获取 Min 值，若 solve() 错误，则输出必然错误。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-61548360973c5cefdc1038d32bf69e3c</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SOLVE()&quot;" target="&quot;小鸡&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小鸡 designed the problem that requires the solve() function to correctly compute element movements after sorting, implying solve() is the intended solution he cannot implement."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SOLVE()&quot;" target="&quot;PERMUTATION P&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"solve() operates on permutation p to answer queries about subinterval sorting and element relocation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SOLVE()&quot;" target="&quot;L_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"solve() must process l_i as input to define the left bound of the subinterval for each query."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SOLVE()&quot;" target="&quot;R_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"solve() must process r_i as input to define the right bound of the subinterval for each query."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SOLVE()&quot;" target="&quot;C_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"solve() must determine the new position of the element originally at c_i after sorting the subinterval."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;字符串外串&quot;" target="&quot;YES&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"YES 是解决‘字符串外串’问题的正确输出之一，但学生程序中被注释，导致程序无法完成有效输出，违背问题要求。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;字符串外串&quot;" target="&quot;可爱度&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"字符串外串是本题的标题，其内容完全围绕‘可爱度’这一概念展开，是该事件的命名来源。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2da9ecfa854ec125c90cf41bc3e549e3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;" target="&quot;连续子串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">69.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"不连续子序列与连续子串是计算‘可爱度’的两个必须相等的结构，构成问题的核心比较关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"不连续子序列和连续子串是‘可爱度’定义中的两个对等元素，必须长度相等且内容相同，共同构成判断标准。"&lt;SEP&gt;"连续子串和不连续子序列是‘可爱度’定义的两个必要组成部分，必须长度相等且内容一致，共同构成判定依据。"&lt;SEP&gt;"连续子串与不连续子序列是‘可爱度’定义中必须相等的两个对象，二者构成问题的核心匹配关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"连续子串 and 不连续子序列 must be of equal length and identical in character sequence to define the可爱度 of the string."&lt;SEP&gt;"连续子串 and 不连续子序列 must be identical in content and length for the可爱度 to be defined as m."&lt;SEP&gt;"不连续子序列必须与连续子串完全相等才能贡献于可爱度，二者必须内容一致，是匹配判定的核心条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79af8c07e093eeaf2a8b54738698e7af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2da9ecfa854ec125c90cf41bc3e549e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8571d78ef0982dfe0d6ef86e585cbe98</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;" target="&quot;(CHAR)('A' + I - 1)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"不连续子序列由前后两段相同字母序列构成，其字符来源于 (char)('a' + i - 1) 的重复构造，是实现该子序列的关键手段。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;" target="&quot;CNT = 2 * M - N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"不连续子序列由前后两段长度为 (n - m) 的子串构成，中间由 cnt 个 'a' 连接，cnt 的值直接影响其结构完整性。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;" target="&quot;可爱度&quot;">
      <data key="d3">57.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"不连续子序列必须与子串完全相同且长度为k，才能使k成为字符串的可爱度。"&lt;SEP&gt;"不连续子序列是定义可爱度的另一必要元素，其特殊结构（至少两段不相邻子串）是本题区别于常规子序列问题的关键。"&lt;SEP&gt;"可爱度的定义要求存在一个与子串相等的不连续子序列，二者构成等式关系，是问题判定的核心。"&lt;SEP&gt;"可爱度 requires a matching length-k non-contiguous subsequence as defined in the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"可爱度的值由最长的可匹配不连续子序列决定，二者必须长度相等且内容一致，是定义的必要条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"可爱度的定义要求一个不连续子序列与某个连续子串完全相等，二者是匹配关系的核心。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-67a35ea6ed4e42eb7c4874b218ee041d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31863a3502540c31035499a1b63c97c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cb4bd7875d45de235db605ada816662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2da9ecfa854ec125c90cf41bc3e549e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd5a87d368619780b9c83a36a26e8d95</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;" target="&quot;子串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"子串与不连续子序列必须长度相等且内容相同，才能使字符串达到可爱度k，二者构成等价约束关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"子串与不连续子序列是可爱度定义中必须相等的两个结构，二者构成问题的核心比较逻辑。"&lt;SEP&gt;"子串和不连续子序列是可爱度定义中必须相等的两个结构，共同构成问题的判定条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-cd5a87d368619780b9c83a36a26e8d95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cb4bd7875d45de235db605ada816662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca7b7c2c9549b0f15b3ed9c255cd57c0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;" target="&quot;CNT = STD::MIN(0LL , 2 * M - N)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"cnt 的计算本意是为不连续子序列提供重复字符，但因表达式错误导致无法构造有效非相邻子串段，是关键缺陷。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-435d0b64fef9c51a64d020305df4c4a9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;" target="&quot;字符串 T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"字符串 t must contain a non-contiguous subsequence (as defined) that matches a substring of the same length to achieve its 可爱度."&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串 t must contain a non-contiguous subsequence of length m that equals a contiguous substring within it to satisfy the可爱度 definition."&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串 t must contain a non-contiguous subsequence of length m, composed of at least two non-adjacent substrings, matching the continuous substring."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-79af8c07e093eeaf2a8b54738698e7af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31863a3502540c31035499a1b63c97c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8571d78ef0982dfe0d6ef86e585cbe98</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;" target="&quot;S&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"s 是生成不连续子序列的基础字符串，其字符分布错误导致无法构造符合定义的不相邻子串序列。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;连续子串&quot;" target="&quot;(CHAR)('A' + I - 1)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"连续子串由 (char)('a' + i - 1) 构造的字母序列组成，是 Student Program 中实现连续子串的底层字符生成方式。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;连续子串&quot;" target="&quot;'A' + I - 1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"'a' + i - 1 用于构造连续子串的前段，意图使连续子串具有唯一字符序列以满足可爱度要求。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-435d0b64fef9c51a64d020305df4c4a9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;连续子串&quot;" target="&quot;'A' + N - I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"'a' + n - i 用于构造连续子串的后段，试图形成对称结构以匹配不连续子序列。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-435d0b64fef9c51a64d020305df4c4a9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;连续子串&quot;" target="&quot;可爱度&quot;">
      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"可爱度 is computed based on the existence of a matching length-k continuous substring."&lt;SEP&gt;"可爱度的值由最长的可匹配连续子串决定，二者直接关联，是问题的输出目标。"&lt;SEP&gt;"可爱度的定义依赖于存在一个与不连续子序列相等的连续子串，两者是构成该度量的必要条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2da9ecfa854ec125c90cf41bc3e549e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31863a3502540c31035499a1b63c97c2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;连续子串&quot;" target="&quot;字符串 T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"字符串 t must contain a contiguous substring of length m that matches a non-contiguous subsequence of the same length to achieve可爱度 m."&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串 t must contain at least one contiguous substring that matches a non-contiguous subsequence of the same length to achieve its 可爱度."&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串 t must contain a continuous substring of length m to satisfy the条件 for可爱度."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-79af8c07e093eeaf2a8b54738698e7af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31863a3502540c31035499a1b63c97c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8571d78ef0982dfe0d6ef86e585cbe98</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;连续子串&quot;" target="&quot;S&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"s 是构造连续子串的载体，程序试图通过 s 的子串匹配来验证可爱度，但构造方式错误导致匹配失败。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;2E5 + 7&quot;" target="&quot;A.CPP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"2e5 + 7 作为常量 M 被用于声明数组大小，是 a.cpp 为处理大数据规模所做的预分配，体现代码的工程设计意图。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2da9ecfa854ec125c90cf41bc3e549e3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;子串&quot;" target="&quot;可爱度&quot;">
      <data key="d3">28.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"可爱度的定义依赖于存在一个与不连续子序列相等的连续子串，子串是其必要组成部分。"&lt;SEP&gt;"子串是计算可爱度所必需的元素之一，必须与不连续子序列相等才能贡献 k 值。"&lt;SEP&gt;"子串的长度直接决定可爱度的候选值，是计算最大k值的核心输入。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-67a35ea6ed4e42eb7c4874b218ee041d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd5a87d368619780b9c83a36a26e8d95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cb4bd7875d45de235db605ada816662</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RAND()&quot;" target="&quot;EXIT(1)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"rand() 生成的 m 值可能为 1，触发 exit(1)，这是对合法输入（m=1）的错误处理，应输出 'NO' 而非终止程序。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RECORD ID: 68-1&quot;" target="&quot;2025-01-23 15:23:07&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"2025-01-23 15:23:07 是Record ID: 68-1 的时间戳，用于精确追踪事件发生时刻。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ca7b7c2c9549b0f15b3ed9c255cd57c0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;YES&quot;" target="&quot;A.CPP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a.cpp 在满足特定条件时输出 YES，但其构造字符串的逻辑存在缺陷（如 cnt 计算错误），可能导致输出的字符串不符合可爱度定义。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2da9ecfa854ec125c90cf41bc3e549e3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;YES&quot;" target="&quot;N - M &gt; 26&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"当 n - m &gt; 26 时，程序应输出 NO，但学生代码错误地在该条件下提前返回 NO，而逻辑上若字母表不足则确实无法构造，此关系是正确性边界。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2da9ecfa854ec125c90cf41bc3e549e3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;NO&quot;" target="&quot;M == 1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"当 m == 1 时，由于不连续子序列必须由至少两段非空子串构成，无法构造长度为1的合法不连续子序列，因此应输出 'NO'，但程序错误使用 exit(1)。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;NO&quot;" target="&quot;A.CPP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a.cpp 的错误实现导致程序在某些情况下输出 NO，但逻辑不正确，可能错误地拒绝了本应有效的输入。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2da9ecfa854ec125c90cf41bc3e549e3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;NO&quot;" target="&quot;N &lt;= M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"当 n &lt;= m 时，程序输出 NO，因为无法在长度 n 的字符串中找到长度为 m 的连续子串与不连续子序列匹配，此为正确逻辑边界。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2da9ecfa854ec125c90cf41bc3e549e3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FLAG&quot;" target="&quot;A[I][J]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The flag variable is used to detect whether any value in a row or column of a[i][j] exceeds 1, influencing the logic of the student’s solution."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fe255a1fe76c6cdfb705f9ea60c587de</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FLAG&quot;" target="&quot;MATRIX&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The flag variable is derived from conditions applied to elements within the matrix (e.g., a[k][3-k+1] &gt; 1), making it dependent on matrix values for correct logic."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7effc3a8936d5e21e04e38b0253505c0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A.CPP&quot;" target="&quot;2025-01-23 16:52:52&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"该时间戳记录了学生提交包含错误的 a.cpp 文件的时刻，用于关联错误答案与具体提交事件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2da9ecfa854ec125c90cf41bc3e549e3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
