    <edge source="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;" target="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;">
      <data key="d3">56.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, activating it to defeat monsters on the grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, activating it to defeat monsters on the grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, activating it to defeat monsters on the grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user who activates the Dragon's Breath attack to defeat monsters on the grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, actively controlling when and where it is unleashed to defeat monsters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, actively choosing coordinates to maximize monster destruction."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2</data>
