    <edge source="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;" target="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">33.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze operates on the Grid Map to choose optimal coordinates for deploying Dragon's Breath."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze uses Dragon's Breath on the Grid Map to eliminate monsters, making the grid the operational domain of her ability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze operates on the grid map, selecting coordinates to target with Dragon's Breath, making the grid the physical domain of her actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze operates on the Grid Map, selecting coordinates to deploy Dragon's Breath and maximize monster elimination."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2</data>
