      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze selects the coordinate (x,y) as the center point to unleash Dragon's Breath."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze selects the coordinate (x,y) as the target for activating Dragon's Breath, making it the origin of the flame pattern."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee</data>
