    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;" target="&quot;ABSOLUTE EXPECTATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">38.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze is the central figure in the problem titled 'Absolute Expectation', which revolves around computing the expected value of val(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the named individual posing or associated with the problem of calculating the absolute expectation of the sequence value."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the originator of the Absolute Expectation problem, which involves computing the expected value of a sequence's absolute difference sum."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the originator or subject of the Absolute Expectation problem, seeking to compute the expected value of the sequence's value function."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f207867e95527d1c21eb90640d585ef3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a6cf2c1b884640bd458e20b236729e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
