    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;" target="&quot;R_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze specifies that each a_i is drawn from an interval bounded by r_i, making r_i a critical input constraint alongside l_i."</data>
