      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze is the person who defines and is analyzing the sequence and its properties in the given problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2a6cf2c1b884640bd458e20b236729e4</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;" target="&quot;VAL(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">28.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze is the one who defines and seeks to compute the expected value of val(a), making val(a) the central mathematical object of interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the person who defines and is interested in computing the value of val(a), making them directly associated with this event."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the person posing the problem and seeking the expected value of val(a), making them directly related to the computation event."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f207867e95527d1c21eb90640d585ef3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">68.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dragon's Breath is a spatial ability that acts upon the Grid Map, destroying monsters along diagonal paths defined by the grid's coordinates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that operates exclusively on the Grid Map, affecting cells along diagonal directions to destroy monsters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an attack mechanism that is defined and applied specifically on the Grid Map, affecting cells along diagonal lines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an attack whose effect is entirely defined by the spatial structure of the Grid Map and its coordinate system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an attack that affects cells on the grid map along diagonal lines, directly interacting with and eliminating monsters located at grid coordinates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that operates on the Grid Map, affecting cells along diagonal paths based on the chosen target coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that operates on the grid map, affecting cells along diagonal lines to destroy monsters."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">38.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dragon's Breath destroys monsters according to the values in a_{i,j} along its diagonal paths, directly interacting with the monster density data."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath destroys monsters according to the values of a_{i,j} at each cell along its diagonal paths."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath destroys monsters whose counts are stored in the a_{i,j} variables along its diagonal paths."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath destroys monsters at each cell (i,j) along its diagonal paths, with a_{i,j} determining the number of monsters eliminated at each point."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;(X-1,Y-1)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">53.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"(x-1,y-1) is a direct extension direction of Dragon's Breath flame, and monsters at this location are destroyed by the attack."&lt;SEP&gt;"(x-1,y-1) is one of the four diagonal directions that define the geometric spread of Dragon's Breath flame."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath propagates along the diagonal direction (x-1,y-1), destroying monsters in that path."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame propagates along the (x-1,y-1) diagonal direction, destroying monsters along that path."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame propagates in the direction of (x-1,y-1) as part of its X-shaped pattern."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath extends infinitely along the (x-1,y-1) diagonal direction, destroying all monsters in that line."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;(X-1,Y+1)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">53.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"(x-1,y+1) is a direct extension direction of Dragon's Breath flame, and monsters at this location are destroyed by the attack."&lt;SEP&gt;"(x-1,y+1) is one of the four diagonal directions that define the geometric spread of Dragon's Breath flame."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath propagates along the diagonal direction (x-1,y+1), destroying monsters in that path."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame propagates along the (x-1,y+1) diagonal direction, destroying monsters along that path."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame propagates in the direction of (x-1,y+1) as part of its X-shaped pattern."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath extends infinitely along the (x-1,y+1) diagonal direction, destroying all monsters in that line."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2</data>
