    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;(X+1,Y-1)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">53.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"(x+1,y-1) is a direct extension direction of Dragon's Breath flame, and monsters at this location are destroyed by the attack."&lt;SEP&gt;"(x+1,y-1) is one of the four diagonal directions that define the geometric spread of Dragon's Breath flame."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath propagates along the diagonal direction (x+1,y-1), destroying monsters in that path."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame propagates along the (x+1,y-1) diagonal direction, destroying monsters along that path."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame propagates in the direction of (x+1,y-1) as part of its X-shaped pattern."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath extends infinitely along the (x+1,y-1) diagonal direction, destroying all monsters in that line."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;(X+1,Y+1)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">53.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"(x+1,y+1) is a direct extension direction of Dragon's Breath flame, and monsters at this location are destroyed by the attack."&lt;SEP&gt;"(x+1,y+1) is one of the four diagonal directions that define the geometric spread of Dragon's Breath flame."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath propagates along the diagonal direction (x+1,y+1), destroying monsters in that path."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame propagates along the (x+1,y+1) diagonal direction, destroying monsters along that path."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath flame propagates in the direction of (x+1,y+1) as part of its X-shaped pattern."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath extends infinitely along the (x+1,y+1) diagonal direction, destroying all monsters in that line."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;(X,Y)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dragon's Breath is centered at coordinate (x,y), from which its diagonal flame patterns originate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is centered at coordinate (x,y), which determines the origin of the 'X'-shaped flame pattern."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is centered at coordinate (x,y), which defines the origin of the 'X'-shaped flame pattern."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;SUM[0][I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum[0][i] precomputes diagonal sums to optimize the calculation of Dragon's Breath impact along one diagonal direction."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;SUM[1][I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum[1][i] precomputes diagonal sums to optimize the calculation of Dragon's Breath impact along the opposite diagonal direction."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2[1][I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum2[1][i] precomputes diagonal sums from the bottom to optimize Dragon's Breath impact calculation for lower rows."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;SUM OF MONSTERS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Sum of monsters is the direct output metric calculated when Dragon's Breath is used at a given coordinate."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;" target="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">49.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Grid Map's monster distribution is fully described by the values of a_{i,j} at each coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_{i,j} defines the monster density at each cell (i,j) of the grid map, making it the foundational data of the grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_{i,j} is the data attribute assigned to each cell (i,j) in the Grid Map, representing monster counts at that location."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_{i,j} is the data attribute of each cell in the Grid Map, specifying the monster count used to evaluate Dragon's Breath effectiveness."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_{i,j} is the data attribute that defines the monster count in each cell of the Grid Map."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;" target="&quot;B[M][M]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"b[M][M] is a temporary storage used to transpose the grid map when n &gt; m, ensuring the algorithm works uniformly."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;(X-1,Y-1)&quot;" target="&quot;SUM[0]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum[0] stores precomputed sums along the (x-1,y-1) diagonal direction to efficiently calculate total monster destruction in that line."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;(X-1,Y+1)&quot;" target="&quot;SUM[1]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum[1] stores precomputed sums along the (x-1,y+1) diagonal direction to efficiently calculate total monster destruction in that line."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;(X+1,Y-1)&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2[0]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum2[0] handles boundary corrections for the (x+1,y-1) diagonal when it extends beyond the grid's lower or left edges."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;(X+1,Y+1)&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2[1]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum2[1] handles boundary corrections for the (x+1,y+1) diagonal when it extends beyond the grid's upper or right edges."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM&quot;" target="&quot;TMP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"tmp conditionally adds values from sum when within matrix bounds, indicating core logic for diagonal sum adjustment."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d887a2fa6fff76122dbcba92f32c0d9f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM&quot;" target="&quot;I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"i indexes the second dimension of sum[1][i]; if i exceeds the declared size of sum, it causes buffer overflow."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM&quot;" target="&quot;A[U][V]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Sum accumulates values from the 2D array a[u][v] during diagonal traversal, making it a core data source for the Sum operation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2[1][I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum2[1][i] stores the result of the Sum operation computed along the upward-right diagonal, directly depending on it."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2[0][I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum2[0][i] stores the result of the Sum operation computed along the downward-left diagonal, directly depending on it."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM2[0][I]&quot;" target="&quot;I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"i is the loop index that determines which diagonal sum is stored in sum2[0][i], linking the iteration variable to the output array."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM2[1][I]&quot;" target="&quot;I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"i is the loop index that determines which diagonal sum is stored in sum2[1][i], linking the iteration variable to the output array."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;79-1&quot;" target="&quot;2025-02-06 13:54:37&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The record ID 79-1 is timestamped at 2025-02-06 13:54:37, indicating when the error was recorded in the system."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d887a2fa6fff76122dbcba92f32c0d9f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM2&quot;" target="&quot;TMP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"tmp conditionally adds values from sum2 when j + i - 1 exceeds column bounds, indicating dependency for boundary handling."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d887a2fa6fff76122dbcba92f32c0d9f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM2&quot;" target="&quot;I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"i indexes the second dimension of sum2[0][i] and sum2[1][i]; improper bounds on i or sum2 dimensions may cause crashes."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;U&quot;" target="&quot;V&quot;">
      <data key="d3">28.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"u and v are co-dependent loop variables that move diagonally across matrix 'a'; their simultaneous modification without proper bounds checking leads to undefined behavior."&lt;SEP&gt;"u and v are paired index variables that decrement together in a while loop to traverse the matrix diagonally from top-right to bottom-left."&lt;SEP&gt;"u and v are co-dependent variables that move in tandem during diagonal traversal — u decrements while v increments (or vice versa), defining diagonal paths in the array."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d887a2fa6fff76122dbcba92f32c0d9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;U&quot;" target="&quot;A[U][V]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"u is the row index used to access elements in the 2D array a[u][v], directly determining which row's values are summed during diagonal traversal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;V&quot;" target="&quot;A[U][V]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"v is the column index used to access elements in the 2D array a[u][v], directly determining which column's values are summed during diagonal traversal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;I&quot;" target="&quot;J&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"i and j are loop variables that iterate over rows and columns of matrix a to evaluate all possible diagonal starting points."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d887a2fa6fff76122dbcba92f32c0d9f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;J&quot;" target="&quot;TMP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"j is used in conjunction with i to index a[i][j], whose value is negated and stored in tmp, indicating tmp depends directly on j."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ABSOLUTE EXPECTATION&quot;" target="&quot;VAL(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Absolute Expectation is the event of computing the expectation of val(a), so val(a) is the random variable whose expectation is sought."&lt;SEP&gt;"Absolute Expectation is the event of computing the expected value of val(a), making val(a) the target quantity of the event."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Absolute Expectation event is the computation of the expected value of the function val(a) over all possible random sequences."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f207867e95527d1c21eb90640d585ef3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a6cf2c1b884640bd458e20b236729e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;L_I&quot;" target="&quot;R_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"l_i and r_i form the inclusive interval [l_i, r_i] from which each a_i is independently and uniformly sampled."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2a6cf2c1b884640bd458e20b236729e4</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VAL(A)&quot;" target="&quot;QUERY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The query function computes the expected contribution of each consecutive pair to val(a), making it the computational engine for the event val(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"query computes the expected absolute difference between each pair of consecutive a_i and a_{i-1}, directly contributing to the total val(a)."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VAL(A)&quot;" target="&quot;SEQUENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The sequence {a_1, ..., a_n} is the input to the function val(a), which computes the sum of absolute differences between consecutive elements."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2a6cf2c1b884640bd458e20b236729e4</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VAL(A)&quot;" target="&quot;QUERY(I, J)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"query(i, j) is the computational mechanism used in the student program to estimate the contribution of each consecutive pair to the total val(a), making it directly tied to the definition of the event."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MOD&quot;" target="&quot;POW&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Pow relies on mod to perform modular exponentiation, making mod a foundational organizational constant for Pow's functionality."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MOD&quot;" target="&quot;QUERY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"query uses mod to maintain consistency in modular arithmetic when combining results from solve, making mod critical to its output."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;POW&quot;" target="&quot;MODULAR ARITHMETIC&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Pow is a function that implements modular exponentiation, a key operation in modular arithmetic for computing inverses."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f207867e95527d1c21eb90640d585ef3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;QUERY&quot;" target="&quot;L[M]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"L[M] provides the lower bounds l_i used by query to compute expected differences via inclusion-exclusion."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;QUERY&quot;" target="&quot;R[M]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"R[M] provides the upper bounds r_i used by query to compute expected differences via inclusion-exclusion."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d3">314.0</data>
      <data key="d4">小L与炸鸡之间构建了一种高度复杂、多层次且动态融合的互动关系，深度融合了教育指导与竞技博弈两大核心维度，形成一种超越传统师生或对手模式的协同进化结构。在教育层面，炸鸡作为小L在数学与计算机科学领域的权威指导者，系统性地教授其基础理论知识，内容涵盖平方与开方运算、位运算（如异或运算 a⊕b=c）以及二进制操作逻辑，为小L奠定了坚实的计算思维基础，并成为其后续问题解决能力发展的核心源头，确立了明确、稳定且直接的教学与指导关系。

在竞技层面，小L与炸鸡正在进行一场井字棋（tic-tac-toe）对局，当前处于残局阶段。为照顾小L作为初学者的经验不足，炸鸡主动授予其一项特殊策略优势——允许小L在每轮中执行两次移动（即“双步特权”或“特殊规则优势”）。这一特权虽带有教学性与包容性意图，甚至在某些语境中可能被解读为轻微的轻视，但双方在对局中均坚持采用最优策略进行博弈，体现出高度的智力对抗性与互动深度。该设计并非削弱竞争，而是通过不对称优势构建一种有引导性的挑战环境，使竞技本身成为教学的延伸。

综上所述，炸鸡既是小L在数学与计算机科学领域的权威教师，也是其在策略游戏中兼具包容性、挑战性与教学意图的对手。二者的关系是教育性、指导性与竞争性的有机统一，既有效促进小L的认知成长与能力提升，也充分彰显炸鸡作为引导者的智慧、策略性与教育远见。尽管存在竞争关系，双方的互动并非零和博弈，而是一种协同进化式的动态结构，其中教学与博弈相互强化，共同塑造了深刻而富有意义的互动范式。</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5df2edc3d03ec6c5e1b9a6d2ff7905f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fbf67613a3aed791c8801433f136cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea15e123e23c10fb0dd1d2aa46c0de25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fa52e5b330629e1cee02304480f542&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180c6e0fe94889fc71026468d48a172f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41bb705f581ef523c90424ea77cfe827&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4815d1a22ec8a935241a5f566cd9c42f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb748d740807dc942d42a2dc4f25d05d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64cb9d6867521174d17ba3213df66180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a376d30d059b09f44ce6681d11e112d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0414d324dc902fa7bfe392b580d12b0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b256fd1c0676b66deece8e4e49ff37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-877df4ea12833328944aec827f97328b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8674c89c2bbd80ac2ed7bf4f4ece7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c22dbdf1f3163e7e66ae88a5409cc589&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a625df4ed1e048ecc8681beebcec0a9e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;平方和开方运算&quot;">
      <data key="d3">36.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"炸鸡 is the source of the平方和开方运算, having introduced these specific mathematical operations to smallL as part of the learning curriculum."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡是平方和开方运算的教授者，这些运算由他引入并作为小L学习的核心内容。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the source who introduced the two mathematical operations (multiply by 2 and integer square root) that define the problem space."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the source of the平方和开方运算, having taught these operations to 小L, establishing direct instructional causality."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5df2edc3d03ec6c5e1b9a6d2ff7905f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180c6e0fe94889fc71026468d48a172f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4815d1a22ec8a935241a5f566cd9c42f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;BIT FLIP OPERATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"炸鸡 taught the concept of bit flipping as one of the fundamental operations in solving the problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;BIT SWAP OPERATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"炸鸡 taught the concept of bit swapping as a higher-cost but potentially more efficient operation for reordering bits."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;位运算教学事件&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"炸鸡是位运算教学事件的发起者和知识传授者，直接建立了教学情境。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;TIC-TAC-TOE GAME&quot;">
      <data key="d3">79.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"炸鸡 is the opponent in the tic-tac-toe game and has intentionally granted 小L a strategic advantage, believing it to be safe."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game who enforces the special rule allowing 小L a double move, reflecting their overconfidence."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game who set the conditions for the game, including granting 小L a double-move privilege."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game who, despite their overconfidence, has introduced a rule modification (double move) that affects the game's strategy."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game, who has intentionally granted a privilege to 小L, underestimating the strategic implications."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game, whose overconfidence leads to the introduction of a rule that may alter the game's balance."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game, whose overconfidence led to granting 小L a rule-breaking advantage that may affect the game's result."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game who has introduced a rule modification (double move) that affects the game's outcome."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game who has introduced a special rule (double move for 小L), influencing the game's strategic dynamics."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game who has intentionally granted a privilege to 小L, affecting the game's strategic dynamics."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the opposing player in the tic-tac-toe game who has intentionally granted 小L a strategic advantage, believing it to be safe."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a376d30d059b09f44ce6681d11e112d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b256fd1c0676b66deece8e4e49ff37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea15e123e23c10fb0dd1d2aa46c0de25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;O&quot;">
      <data key="d3">164.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"'O' is the symbol used to represent 炸鸡's moves on the board, directly associating the mark with the player's actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"O is the symbol used by 炸鸡 to mark their moves on the tic-tac-toe board, directly representing 炸鸡's actions in the game."&lt;SEP&gt;炸鸡 uses the symbol "O" to mark their moves on the tic-tac-toe board, establishing a direct and consistent association between the player and their game piece. Every "O" placed on the 3x3 grid represents an action taken by 炸鸡 during their turn, signifying their ownership of that cell and their strategic effort to create a winning line while simultaneously blocking opponents such as 小L. The symbol "O" is not merely a marker but a direct representation of 炸鸡’s identity and actions within the game, consistently used across all descriptions to denote their moves with clarity and uniformity. This association is fundamental to gameplay, allowing players and observers to instantly identify 炸鸡’s contributions to the board state.</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41bb705f581ef523c90424ea77cfe827&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a376d30d059b09f44ce6681d11e112d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0414d324dc902fa7bfe392b580d12b0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b256fd1c0676b66deece8e4e49ff37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8674c89c2bbd80ac2ed7bf4f4ece7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea15e123e23c10fb0dd1d2aa46c0de25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a625df4ed1e048ecc8681beebcec0a9e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;井字棋&quot;">
      <data key="d3">79.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"炸鸡作为井字棋的另一名玩家，通过给予特权展现自信，但其策略仍基于游戏规则和最优博弈逻辑。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡是井字棋对局的另一位参与者，以高智商策略应对小L的特权，试图阻止其获胜。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡是井字棋对局的另一方，以理性策略应对小L的特权，代表博弈中的对抗性智能。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡是井字棋对局的另一方，其策略将对抗小L的特权，目标是阻止小L必胜。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡是井字棋对局的另一方玩家，以聪明策略应对小L的特权，试图阻止其获胜。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡是井字棋游戏的另一位参与者，以聪明策略著称，其行为影响小L能否必胜的分析结果。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡是井字棋对局的另一方玩家，其策略目标是阻止小L获胜，即使在对方拥有特权的情况下仍坚持最优应对。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡是井字棋对局的另一方参与者，以最优策略应对小L的特权行动，试图阻止其获胜。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡是井字棋对局的另一方，其策略和特权设置构成了判断小L能否必胜的核心条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡是井字棋对局的另一位参与者，以最优策略应对小L的双步特权，代表理性对手的博弈立场。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-64cb9d6867521174d17ba3213df66180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41bb705f581ef523c90424ea77cfe827&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0414d324dc902fa7bfe392b580d12b0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fbf67613a3aed791c8801433f136cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8674c89c2bbd80ac2ed7bf4f4ece7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a625df4ed1e048ecc8681beebcec0a9e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
