    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小L&quot;" target="&quot;TIC-TAC-TOE GAME&quot;">
      <data key="d3">90.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小L is a participant in the tic-tac-toe game and is currently to move, with a special rule advantage that could determine the outcome."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is a primary participant in the tic-tac-toe game, attempting to win using a special double-move privilege under optimal play conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is a primary participant in the tic-tac-toe game, benefiting from a unique rule that allows one double move to compensate for their beginner status."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is a primary participant in the tic-tac-toe game, whose strategy and the special privilege granted to them are central to determining the game's outcome."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is an active participant in the tic-tac-toe game, currently about to make a move under special rules that may determine the outcome."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is an active participant in the tic-tac-toe game, currently about to make a move with a special privilege that could determine the outcome."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is an active participant in the tic-tac-toe game, currently holding the turn with a unique advantage to make two consecutive moves."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is an active participant in the tic-tac-toe game, currently holding the turn with a special double-move privilege that could determine the outcome."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is one of the two participants in the tic-tac-toe game and is currently about to make a move with a special two-move privilege."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is a primary participant in the tic-tac-toe game, currently taking their turn with a special double-move privilege that could influence the outcome."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is one of the two participants in the tic-tac-toe game and is currently awaiting their turn with a special double-move privilege."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a376d30d059b09f44ce6681d11e112d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b256fd1c0676b66deece8e4e49ff37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea15e123e23c10fb0dd1d2aa46c0de25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
