    <edge source="&quot;数字M&quot;" target="&quot;WHILE(M % 2 == 0) M /= 2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"数字m is the target value being modified by this loop, which incorrectly simplifies m by dividing out factors of 2 without considering the reverse operation logic."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-bb748d740807dc942d42a2dc4f25d05d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;数字M&quot;" target="&quot;小L的数学题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"数字m是小L数学题的目标输出，是问题是否可解的判定标准，构成事件的核心目标。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-877df4ea12833328944aec827f97328b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;数字M&quot;" target="&quot;平方和开方运算&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"数字m是平方和开方运算的期望输出结果，运算的合法性由是否能到达m判断。"&lt;SEP&gt;"数字m是平方和开方运算试图达到的目标输出，运算过程围绕其可达成性展开。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fa52e5b330629e1cee02304480f542</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;平方和开方运算&quot;" target="&quot;STD::SQRT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"std::sqrt is the computational implementation of the 开方 (square root) operation taught by 炸鸡, though the program fails to handle the floor operation correctly."&lt;SEP&gt;"std::sqrt is the direct implementation of the '开平方后下取整' operation taught by 炸鸡, forming the technical realization of the mathematical rule."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb748d740807dc942d42a2dc4f25d05d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
