      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The while loop attempting to divide m by 2 is an incorrect reverse-engineering of the 乘以2 (multiply by 2) operation, misrepresenting the bidirectional nature of the allowed operations."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-bb748d740807dc942d42a2dc4f25d05d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;平方和开方运算&quot;" target="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The BFS algorithm is designed to systematically apply the square and square-root operations to find a path from n to m."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c22dbdf1f3163e7e66ae88a5409cc589</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A⊕B=C求解事件&quot;" target="&quot;Y&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"y是a⊕b=c求解事件中的关键成本参数，与x比较后决定最优操作组合，直接影响最小花费计算。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;Y&quot;" target="&quot;BIT SWAP OPERATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The cost parameter 'y' determines the expense of each bit swap operation on a or b."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;Y&quot;" target="&quot;交换操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"y是执行交换操作的单位成本，与x比较后决定使用交换还是多次翻转更经济。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A⊕B=C&quot;" target="&quot;翻转操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"翻转操作是实现a⊕b=c目标的直接手段之一，通过改变a或b的某一位来调整异或结果。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A⊕B=C&quot;" target="&quot;交换操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"交换操作是实现a⊕b=c目标的另一种直接手段，通过重新排列a或b的位来匹配c的模式。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BIT FLIP OPERATION&quot;" target="&quot;BIT SWAP OPERATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Both operations are alternative methods to adjust bits in a and b to achieve a⊕b=c, with different cost structures (x vs y), leading to optimization trade-offs."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;按位异或运算&quot;" target="&quot;最小花费问题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"按位异或运算是最小花费问题的约束条件，所有操作的最终目标是使a⊕b=c成立。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;翻转操作&quot;" target="&quot;最小花费问题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"翻转操作是解决最小花费问题的两种基本操作之一，其成本x直接影响最优解的计算。"&lt;SEP&gt;"翻转操作是解决最小花费问题的两种基本操作之一，直接影响总成本。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;交换操作&quot;" target="&quot;最小花费问题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">26.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"交换操作是解决最小花费问题的两种基本操作之一，直接影响总成本。"&lt;SEP&gt;"交换操作是解决最小花费问题的第二种基本操作，其成本y与翻转成本的比较决定最优策略。"&lt;SEP&gt;"交换操作是解决最小花费问题的两种高级操作之一，每次花费y元，影响总成本计算。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;最小花费问题&quot;" target="&quot;反置操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"反置操作是解决最小花费问题的两种基本操作之一，每次花费x元，影响总成本计算。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;学生程序错误&quot;" target="&quot;STD::MAP&lt;INT, INT&gt;&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student’s program fails due to a missing semicolon after std::map&lt;int, int&gt; f, causing a compilation error that breaks the BFS implementation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c22dbdf1f3163e7e66ae88a5409cc589</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;学生程序错误&quot;" target="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The BFS algorithm’s implementation is rendered non-functional due to the syntax error in the C++ code, directly linking the algorithmic design to the programming mistake."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c22dbdf1f3163e7e66ae88a5409cc589</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TIC-TAC-TOE GAME&quot;" target="&quot;G&quot;">
      <data key="d3">51.0</data>
