      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"《小鸡的排列构造》is the problem context that defines the structure and requirements of the Query l_i, r_i, c_i, making the query type a direct instantiation of the problem’s task."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5fbb166f8ec0a1178f2d878ecaab5e98</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;《小鸡的排列构造》&quot;" target="&quot;18.75&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"《小鸡的排列构造》题目的复杂度要求是评判学生程序得分18.75的基准，得分低表明程序未满足题目对checker的正确性与效率要求。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
