      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"《小鸡的排列构造》requires a solution that can answer subarray sorting position queries efficiently, which the Persistent Segment Tree is designed to provide."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
