    <edge source="&quot;《小鸡的排列构造》&quot;" target="&quot;SUBINTERVAL [L_I, R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"《小鸡的排列构造》introduces the concept of querying subintervals within a permutation, which is the core operation of this problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
